{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0135fvToH5PwNqk5wHca6ucB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median 档核心叙事：C1-C7 诊断主线完全成立（31+ 配置、2+ 环境），C8 降级为 \"exploratory\n2\t  forward-pass intervention\"。\n3\t\n4\t  TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker Walk 上是项目首个完全预防 CIVO 的干预（s0 NVE 全程 < 1.0×，eval peak 821），\n5\t\n6\t  但 s1 eval peak 显著低于 s0（< 500），Cheetah σ=0.5 失败（NVE 3-20×）。\n7\t\n8\t  最优 σ 是 environment-specific 且 narrow band（σ=0.1 不足、σ=0.5 过量、σ=0.2 仅 Walker 有效），\n9\t\n10\t  无 universal σ 存在。Forward-pass principle 方向正确但实现需要 adaptive calibration（超出本文 scope）。\n11\t\n12\t\n13\t  叙事重心移回诊断：SGS 全面失败（C7, 1/17 across 3 variants）+ TCN Walker 成功 + TCN Cheetah 失败\n14\t\n15\t  共同构成 \"干预难度梯度\"——backward-pass (SGS) < forward-pass uniform noise (TCN) < (future)\n16\t  adaptive forward-pass。\n17\t\n18\t  C8 标题从 \"forward-pass intervention\" 改为 \"exploratory forward-pass intervention\"，\n19\t\n20\t  所有 TCN 结论加 \"Walker Walk only\" scope 限定，Cheetah 失败作为 \"calibration challenge\" 呈现。\n21\t\n22\t\n23\t  Running experiments 预测：\n24\t\n25\t  - exp_029a (TCN Walker s1 σ=0.2)：NVE 保持 < 1.5×，eval peak ~450（远低于 s0 的 821），prevention\n26\t  成功但性能不可泛化\n27\t\n28\t  - exp_030b (TCN Cheetah s0 σ=0.5)：NVE 3-15×，eval peak ~120-200，Cheetah severity\n29\t  gap 无法被 σ=0.5 覆盖\n30\t\n31\t  - exp_029c (TCN Walker s0 σ=0.1)：NVE 可能 breach 1.5×（噪声不足），eval peak ~300-500\n32\t\n33\t  - exp_031 (TCN PickCube s0 σ=0.2)：预计 negative——PickCube 动力学与 locomotion 差异大，σ=0.2\n34\t  未必适用\n35\t\n36\t\n37\t  Paper claims：C1-C7 fully supported (7 claims)，C8 partial (scoped to Walker proof-of-concept)。\n38\t\n39\t  CoRL reviewer 可能要求补充 environment 或 challenge robustness——准备 rebuttal 强调诊断贡献独立于 C8。\n40\t\n41\t  '\n42\timagined_experiments:\n43\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n44\t  plan_id: plan_011\n45\t  description: 'Replicate CIVO trigger with 2 additional independent seeds. 008d config:\n46\t    dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8.'\n47\t  expected_results:\n48\t    seed1:\n49\t      eval_trajectory:\n50\t        5K: 31\n51\t        15K: 155\n52\t        25K: 170\n53\t        35K: 150\n54\t        45K: 143\n55\t        55K: 85\n56\t        65K: 245\n57\t        75K: 180\n58\t        85K: 200\n59\t        95K: 135\n60\t        105K: 130\n61\t      eval_peak: 245\n62\t      eval_peak_step: 65K\n63\t      eval_final: 130\n64\t      nve_25K: 1.78\n65\t      nve_35K: 1.71\n66\t      nve_45K: 2.09\n67\t      nve_55K: 4.12\n68\t      nve_peak: 4.12\n69\t      nve_peak_step: 55K\n70\t      collapse: true\n71\t      collapse_type: classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy decreasing)\n72\t      collapse_onset: 25K\n73\t    seed2:\n74\t      eval_trajectory:\n75\t        5K: 39\n76\t        15K: 144\n77\t        25K: 141\n78\t        35K: 164\n79\t        45K: 141\n80\t        55K: 172\n81\t        65K: 209\n82\t        75K: 197\n83\t        85K: 236\n84\t        95K: 279\n85\t        105K: 268\n86\t      eval_peak: 279\n87\t      eval_peak_step: 95K\n88\t      eval_final: 268\n89\t      nve_25K: 2.05\n90\t      nve_35K: 1.24\n91\t      nve_45K: 1.62\n92\t      nve_55K: 1.41\n93\t      nve_65K: 0.94\n94\t      nve_75K: 0.66\n95\t      nve_85K: 0.51\n96\t      nve_95K: 0.43\n97\t      nve_105K: 0.38\n98\t      nve_peak: 2.05\n99\t      nve_peak_step: 25K\n100\t      collapse: false\n101\t      collapse_type: transient CIVO, self-correction\n102\t    cross_seed_summary:\n103\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 2/2 seeds\n104\t      collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n105\t      nve_threshold_separating_power: maintained — both seeds exceed 1.5× at some\n106\t        point\n107\t  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 可靠地诱导 NVE > 1.5×（2/2 seeds），因为 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 fidelity\n108\t    gap\n109\t\n110\t    通过精确的 dt_embedding conditioning 被放大为系统性 reward overestimation。\n111\t\n112\t    Collapse 是 stochastic 的（1/2），取决于训练早期的随机性（权重初始化、mini-batch 采样序列）\n113\t\n114\t    是否让 NVE 跨过 \"point of no return\" threshold 从而锁定正反馈循环。\n115\t\n116\t    Seed 2 在 45K 后 NVE 开始下降（1.62→0.38），展示了 value self-correction——\n117\t\n118\t    early stochasticity 使其避开了持续 overestimation 的轨迹。\n119\t\n120\t    '\n121\t  tables:\n122\t  - title: 008d cross-seed NVE comparison\n123\t    columns:\n124\t    - step\n125\t    - seed1_nve\n126\t    - seed2_nve\n127\t    - pathological_threshold\n128\t    rows:\n129\t    - - 25K\n130\t      - 1.78\n131\t      - 2.05\n132\t      - 1.5\n133\t    - - 35K\n134\t      - 1.71\n135\t      - 1.24\n136\t      - 1.5\n137\t    - - 45K\n138\t      - 2.09\n139\t      - 1.62\n140\t      - 1.5\n141\t    - - 55K\n142\t      - 4.12\n143\t      - 1.41\n144\t      - 1.5\n145\t    - - 105K\n146\t      - collapsed\n147\t      - 0.38\n148\t      - 1.5\n149\t  figures_description:\n150\t  - 'Fig A: 008d seed 1 vs seed 2 eval trajectory — seed 1 collapses at 55K while\n151\t    seed 2 shows slow recovery to 268'\n152\t  - 'Fig B: NVE trajectory overlay — both exceed 1.5× early, seed 1 accelerates (sustained),\n153\t    seed 2 self-corrects (transient)'\n154\t  analysis: 'C2 因果方向在两个独立 seed 上复现。NVE > 1.5× threshold 的 separating power\n155\t\n156\t    从 4/4 (原始) 维持。关键新增发现：value self-correction mechanism (seed 2)\n157\t\n158\t    的存在说明 CIVO 不是 deterministic collapse 而是 stochastic bifurcation——\n159\t\n160\t    early training dynamics 决定 sustained vs transient 轨迹。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n164\t  plan_id: plan_012\n165\t  description: Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no CIVO) with additional\n166\t    seeds.\n167\t  expected_results:\n168\t    seed1:\n169\t      eval_trajectory:\n170\t        5K: 30\n171\t        15K: 165\n172\t        25K: 195\n173\t        35K: 210\n174\t        45K: 190\n175\t        55K: 175\n176\t        65K: 370\n177\t        75K: 320\n178\t        85K: 250\n179\t        95K: 320\n180\t        105K: 500\n181\t      eval_peak: 500\n182\t      eval_peak_step: 105K\n183\t      eval_final: 500\n184\t      nve_max_35kplus: 1.02\n185\t      nve_105K: 0.3\n186\t      collapse: false\n187\t      reward_MAE: 0.75\n188\t    seed2:\n189\t      eval_trajectory:\n190\t        5K: 30\n191\t        15K: 157\n192\t        25K: 169\n193\t        35K: 179\n194\t        45K: 211\n195\t        55K: 239\n196\t        65K: 244\n197\t        75K: 359\n198\t        85K: 227\n199\t        95K: 191\n200\t        105K: 148\n201\t      eval_peak: 359\n202\t      eval_peak_step: 75K\n203\t      eval_final: 148\n204\t      nve_max_35kplus: 1.26\n205\t      nve_105K: 1.14\n206\t      collapse: false\n207\t      pattern: peak-then-decline, no CIVO but poor late performance\n208\t    seed3:\n209\t      eval_trajectory:\n210\t        5K: 31\n211\t        15K: 148\n212\t        25K: 180\n213\t        35K: 220\n214\t        45K: 255\n215\t        55K: 300\n216\t        65K: 280\n217\t        75K: 310\n218\t        85K: 350\n219\t        95K: 290\n220\t        105K: 312\n221\t      eval_peak: 350\n222\t      eval_peak_step: 85K\n223\t      eval_final: 312\n224\t      nve_max_35kplus: 0.85\n225\t      nve_105K: 0.52\n226\t      collapse: false\n227\t    seed4:\n228\t      eval_peak: 488\n229\t      eval_final: 307\n230\t      nve_peak: 1.41\n231\t      nve_105K: 0.58\n232\t      collapse: false\n233\t    cross_seed_summary:\n234\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 0/4 seeds\n235\t      collapse_rate: 0/4\n236\t      eval_range_105K: '[148, 500]'\n237\t      mean_nve_105K: 0.64\n238\t  result_rationale: '去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01×\n239\t    vs 008d 的 2.78×），\n240\t\n241\t    reward_MAE 升至 baseline 75×。CIVO 反馈循环被完全阻断——critic 无法利用精确的 dt 信号\n242\t\n243\t    进行 value exploitation。所有 seed 的 NVE 保持 < 1.5×（最高 1.26×，瞬态）。\n244\t\n245\t    但性能受限（eval 148-500 vs baseline 916）因为模型丧失了所有时间信息编码能力。\n246\t\n247\t    Seed 间高 variance（148-500）反映了无时间信息条件下的学习不稳定性。\n248\t\n249\t    '\n250\t  tables:\n251\t  - title: 'No-dt-emb causal control: 4-seed summary'\n252\t    columns:\n253\t    - seed\n254\t    - eval_peak\n255\t    - eval_105K\n256\t    - nve_peak\n257\t    - nve_105K\n258\t    - CIVO\n259\t    rows:\n260\t    - - 1\n261\t      - 500\n262\t      - 500\n263\t      - 1.02\n264\t      - 0.3\n265\t      - 'No'\n266\t    - - 2\n267\t      - 359\n268\t      - 148\n269\t      - 1.26\n270\t      - 1.14\n271\t      - 'No'\n272\t    - - 3\n273\t      - 350\n274\t      - 312\n275\t      - 0.85\n276\t      - 0.52\n277\t      - 'No'\n278\t    - - 4\n279\t      - 488\n280\t      - 307\n281\t      - 1.41\n282\t      - 0.58\n283\t      - 'No'\n284\t  figures_description:\n285\t  - 'Fig: 008f 4-seed NVE overlay — all seeds remain below 1.5× threshold (dashed\n286\t    line), contrasting sharply with 008d''s 2/2 breaches'\n287\t  analysis: '因果控制在 4 seeds 上 100% 复现（0/4 CIVO）。与 008d 的对比：trained dt_emb 2/2 exceed\n288\t    1.5×，\n289\t\n290\t    no dt_emb 0/4 exceed 1.5× → 6/6 perfect classification on this pair。\n291\t\n292\t    008f 的角色是因果控制实验（非推荐方案），证明 dt_embedding conditioning 是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n293\t\n294\t    '\n295\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n296\t  plan_id: plan_013\n297\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with unexposed dt_emb (trained but\n298\t    only on dt=1 data). Subsample OFF + H=15.\n299\t  expected_results:\n300\t    seed1:\n301\t      eval_trajectory:\n302\t        5K: 31\n303\t        15K: 167\n304\t        25K: 140\n305\t        35K: 394\n306\t        45K: 414\n307\t        55K: 441\n308\t        65K: 492\n309\t        75K: 452\n310\t        85K: 547\n311\t        95K: 629\n312\t        105K: 631\n313\t      eval_peak: 631\n314\t      eval_peak_step: 105K\n315\t      eval_final: 631\n316\t      nve_105K: 0.43\n317\t      civo_alert: 0\n318\t      pattern: slow but steady climb, no zigzag\n319\t    seed2:\n320\t      eval_trajectory:\n321\t        5K: 31\n322\t        15K: 175\n323\t        25K: 280\n324\t        35K: 410\n325\t        45K: 380\n326\t        55K: 608\n327\t        65K: 654\n328\t        75K: 534\n329\t        85K: 605\n330\t        95K: 819\n331\t        105K: 899\n332\t      eval_peak: 899\n333\t      eval_peak_step: 105K\n334\t      eval_final: 899\n335\t      nve_105K: 0.33\n336\t      civo_alert: 0\n337\t      pattern: strong recovery, near-baseline performance\n338\t    cross_seed_summary:\n339\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 0/2\n340\t      collapse_rate: 0/2\n341\t      eval_range_105K: '[631, 899]'\n342\t      mean_eval_105K: 765\n343\t      vs_baseline_105K: -5% to -31%\n344\t  result_rationale: 'Unexposed dt_emb（trained 但仅见过 dt=1 数据）保留了有用的时间表征但无法被 dt>1 exploitation。\n345\t\n346\t    因为 subsample OFF 意味着训练数据全部是 dt=1 transitions，dt_embedding 学到的是 dt=1 的表征——\n347\t\n348\t    当 imagination 用 dt=2 时，embedding 提供的是不精确的（dt=1-tuned）信号，\n349\t\n350\t    critic 无法建立精确 dt>1 conditioning → CIVO 反馈循环无法启动。\n351\t\n352\t    Value growth 被抑制在 baseline 水平以下（NVE 0.33-0.43×），性能保留 69-98% baseline。\n353\t\n354\t    '\n355\t  tables:\n356\t  - title: 'Unexposed dt_emb: value suppression evidence'\n357\t    columns:\n358\t    - seed\n359\t    - eval_105K\n360\t    - nve_105K\n361\t    - vs_baseline\n362\t    - pattern\n363\t    rows:\n364\t    - - 0\n365\t      - 778\n366\t      - 0.59\n367\t      - -15.1%\n368\t      - zigzag two-cycle recovery\n369\t    - - 1\n370\t      - 631\n371\t      - 0.43\n372\t      - -31.1%\n373\t      - slow steady climb\n374\t    - - 2\n375\t      - 899\n376\t      - 0.33\n377\t      - -1.8%\n378\t      - strong recovery\n379\t  figures_description:\n380\t  - 'Fig: 3-seed 008a eval trajectory — all show recovery patterns (zigzag or steady),\n381\t    none collapse'\n382\t  - 'Fig: NVE overlay — all seeds maintain NVE < 1.0× at 105K, confirming structural\n383\t    value suppression'\n384\t  analysis: 'C3 在 3 seeds (含原始 s0) 上确认：unexposed dt_emb 可靠抑制 value overestimation\n385\t    (0/3 CIVO)。\n386\t\n387\t    性能范围 631-899 (69-98% baseline) 远优于 008f (148-500, 16-55%)，\n388\t\n389\t    说明保留 dt_embedding 架构但不暴露于 dt>1 数据是更优的 value protection 策略。\n390\t\n391\t    Seed 间 variance (631 vs 899) 反映了正常的 RL 训练随机性，非系统性问题。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imag mitigation) seeds 1-2\n395\t  plan_id: plan_014\n396\t  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination with trained dt_emb. Tests\n397\t    whether restricting imagination prevents collapse.\n398\t  expected_results:\n399\t    seed1:\n400\t      eval_trajectory:\n401\t        5K: 31\n402\t        15K: 131\n403\t        25K: 156\n404\t        35K: 276\n405\t        45K: 382\n406\t        55K: 487\n407\t        65K: 581\n408\t        75K: 574\n409\t        85K: 657\n410\t        95K: 852\n411\t        105K: 870\n412\t      eval_peak: 870\n413\t      eval_peak_step: 105K\n414\t      nve_stable_range: 0.72-0.80×\n415\t      nve_peak: 0.8\n416\t      collapse: false\n417\t      gate_dt_mean: 1.0\n418\t    seed2:\n419\t      eval_trajectory:\n420\t        5K: 39\n421\t        15K: 181\n422\t        25K: 212\n423\t        35K: 320\n424\t        45K: 357\n425\t        55K: 418\n426\t        65K: 435\n427\t        75K: 577\n428\t        85K: 715\n429\t        95K: 452\n430\t        105K: 137\n431\t      eval_peak: 715\n432\t      eval_peak_step: 85K\n433\t      eval_final: 137\n434\t      nve_85K: 0.68\n435\t      nve_95K: 1.34\n436\t      nve_105K: 3.78\n437\t      collapse: true\n438\t      collapse_onset: 95K\n439\t      collapse_type: non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy increasing)\n440\t      actor_entropy_85K: -5.21\n441\t      actor_entropy_105K: -3.83\n442\t      gate_dt_mean: 1.0\n443\t    cross_seed_summary:\n444\t      collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n445\t      c6_status: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED\n446\t  result_rationale: 'dt=1 imagination 消除了 CIVO Pathway A（value 驱动的 overestimation），seed\n447\t    1 因此健康（NVE 0.80×）。\n448\t\n449\t    但 trained dt_emb 在 dt>1 训练数据上学到的表征会改变 RSSM 的 latent space 结构——\n450\t\n451\t    即使 imagination 限制为 dt=1，被 dt>1 训练数据 \"污染\" 的表征仍可能导致\n452\t\n453\t    Pathway B（eval 驱动的 policy instability）。Seed 2 的崩溃动力学与经典 CIVO 定性不同：\n454\t\n455\t    value 温和变化 (+13%→-12%) 而 eval 暴跌 (-81%)，actor entropy 上升（策略变随机）——\n456\t\n457\t    这是 policy destabilization 而非 critic exploitation。\n458\t\n459\t    Collapse rate 1/2 与 008d (1/2) 相同，说明 dt=1 imagination 未降低总崩溃概率，\n460\t\n461\t    只是将机制从 CIVO 切换为 non-CIVO policy instability。\n462\t\n463\t    '\n464\t  tables:\n465\t  - title: 008e_v3 dual-pathway collapse comparison\n466\t    columns:\n467\t    - feature\n468\t    - 008d_s1_CIVO\n469\t    - 008e_v3_s2_nonCIVO\n470\t    rows:\n471\t    - - value change\n472\t      - +130% (60→138)\n473\t      - +13% (339→384)\n474\t    - - eval change\n475\t      - -43% (146→83)\n476\t      - -81% (715→137)\n477\t    - - NVE driver\n478\t      - value numerator explosion\n479\t      - eval denominator collapse\n480\t    - - actor_entropy\n481\t      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n482\t      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n483\t    - - mechanism\n484\t      - critic overestimate → actor exploit\n485\t      - eval crash → value lags\n486\t  figures_description:\n487\t  - 'Fig: 008e_v3 seed 1 (healthy) vs seed 2 (collapsed) eval trajectories with baseline\n488\t    overlay'\n489\t  - 'Fig: actor_entropy comparison — CIVO pathway (008d) shows entropy decrease vs\n490\t    non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2) shows entropy increase'\n491\t  analysis: 'C6 partially falsified: dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)。\n492\t\n493\t    但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 不同 → trained dt_embedding 通过多条路径创造脆弱性。\n494\t\n495\t    009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。\n496\t\n497\t    论文表述：dt=1 imagination eliminates CIVO (Pathway A) but not all failure modes。\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n501\t  plan_id: plan_015\n502\t  description: Freeze dt_embedding (requires_grad=False), random init. Diagnoses whether\n503\t    dt_emb TRAINING is the necessary condition for CIVO.\n504\t  expected_results:\n505\t    eval_trajectory:\n506\t      5K: 31\n507\t      15K: 168\n508\t      25K: 172\n509\t      35K: 202\n510\t      45K: 122\n511\t      55K: 106\n512\t      65K: 160\n513\t      75K: 80\n514\t      85K: 184\n515\t      95K: 238\n516\t      105K: 204\n517\t    eval_peak: 238\n518\t    eval_peak_step: 95K\n519\t    eval_final: 204\n520\t    nve_85K: 0.47\n521\t    nve_95K: 0.39\n522\t    nve_105K: 0.42\n523\t    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n524\t    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n525\t    value_mean_105K: 56.2\n526\t    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n527\t    collapse: false\n528\t    collapse_mechanism: gradient starvation from frozen dt_emb\n529\t  result_rationale: '冻结 dt_emb 阻止了训练驱动的 co-adaptation → NVE 保持健康 (0.39-0.47×)，远低于\n530\t    1.5× 阈值。\n531\t\n532\t    但冻结的随机 embedding 向 RSSM 注入持续的无信息噪声信号，模型必须学会忽略它。\n533\t\n534\t    这导致 actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）：value landscape 在 embedding-conditioned states 周围变得平坦，\n535\t\n536\t    actor 无法获得有效的梯度信号来改进策略。性能严重受限（204 vs baseline 916, 22%）。\n537\t\n538\t    关键诊断结论：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——冻结 (015b) 和移除 (008f) 都阻止了 CIVO，\n539\t\n540\t    但各自引入不同的性能损伤机制（梯度饥饿 vs reward 预测失败）。\n541\t\n542\t    '\n543\t  tables:\n544\t  - title: 2×2 dt_emb intervention matrix\n545\t    columns:\n546\t    - config\n547\t    - dt_emb_status\n548\t    - CIVO\n549\t    - eval_105K\n550\t    - mechanism\n551\t    rows:\n552\t    - - 008d\n553\t      - trained + active\n554\t      - Yes (2/2)\n555\t      - 82-268\n556\t      - CIVO feedback loop\n557\t    - - 008a\n558\t      - trained + unexposed\n559\t      - No (0/3)\n560\t      - 631-899\n561\t      - value suppression\n562\t    - - 015b\n563\t      - frozen (random)\n564\t      - No (0/1)\n565\t      - '204'\n566\t      - gradient starvation\n567\t    - - 008f\n568\t      - removed (dim=0)\n569\t      - No (0/4)\n570\t      - 148-500\n571\t      - reward prediction failure\n572\t  figures_description:\n573\t  - 'Fig: 4-config comparison showing eval trajectories and NVE — only trained+active\n574\t    shows CIVO'\n575\t  analysis: '015b 与 008d、008a、008f 构成完整的 2×2 消融矩阵。\n576\t\n577\t    只有 \"trained + active\" 配置触发 CIVO，确认 dt_emb 的训练过程（而非其存在本身）是 necessary condition。\n578\t\n579\t    这支持 C2 的 mechanistic claim：训练过程使 dt_emb 学到精确但错误的 dt>1 conditioning，\n580\t\n581\t    而非 dt_emb 的架构存在本身导致问题。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n585\t  plan_id: plan_016\n586\t  description: Narrow 008e_v3 collapse probability estimate from 1/2 to x/4.\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    seed3:\n589\t      eval_trajectory:\n590\t        5K: 35\n591\t        15K: 145\n592\t        25K: 195\n593\t        35K: 310\n594\t        45K: 380\n595\t        55K: 440\n596\t        65K: 460\n597\t        75K: 510\n598\t        85K: 520\n599\t        95K: 320\n600\t        105K: 93\n601\t      eval_peak: 520\n602\t      eval_peak_step: 85K\n603\t      eval_final: 93\n604\t      nve_peak: 4.02\n605\t      nve_peak_step: 105K\n606\t      collapse: true\n607\t      collapse_onset: 85-95K\n608\t      collapse_type: hybrid — eval-driven with moderate value acceleration\n609\t    seed4:\n610\t      eval_trajectory:\n611\t        5K: 38\n612\t        15K: 160\n613\t        25K: 200\n614\t        35K: 330\n615\t        45K: 420\n616\t        55K: 510\n617\t        65K: 600\n618\t        75K: 640\n619\t        85K: 720\n620\t        95K: 830\n621\t        105K: 899\n622\t      eval_peak: 899\n623\t      eval_peak_step: 105K\n624\t      eval_final: 899\n625\t      nve_peak: 0.99\n626\t      collapse: false\n627\t    cross_seed_summary:\n628\t      total_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n629\t      collapsed_seeds:\n630\t      - 2\n631\t      - 3\n632\t      healthy_seeds:\n633\t      - 1\n634\t      - 4\n635\t      collapse_probability_estimate: 50% ± 25% (binomial CI)\n636\t  result_rationale: '4 seeds 中 2 个崩溃（50%），与 008d 的 50% 崩溃率一致。\n637\t\n638\t    dt=1 imagination 确实消除了 CIVO Pathway A，但 Pathway B（eval-driven policy instability）\n639\t\n640\t    的基准崩溃概率仍然是 ~50%，与 dt=2 imagination 下的 CIVO 崩溃概率没有显著差异。\n641\t\n642\t    这说明 trained dt_emb 的脆弱性不仅在于 imagination 中的 dt>1 使用，\n643\t\n644\t    而在于训练数据中 dt>1 transitions 对 latent representation 的全局影响。\n645\t\n646\t    Healthy seeds (1, 4) 达到 870-899 (95-98% baseline)，说明当 Pathway B 不触发时，\n647\t\n648\t    dt=1 imagination 配置的性能上限接近 baseline。\n649\t\n650\t    '\n651\t  tables:\n652\t  - title: 008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\n653\t    columns:\n654\t    - seed\n655\t    - eval_105K\n656\t    - nve_peak\n657\t    - collapsed\n658\t    - pathway\n659\t    rows:\n660\t    - - 1\n661\t      - 870\n662\t      - 0.8\n663\t      - 'No'\n664\t      - —\n665\t    - - 2\n666\t      - 137\n667\t      - 3.78\n668\t      - 'Yes'\n669\t      - B (eval-driven)\n670\t    - - 3\n671\t      - 93\n672\t      - 4.02\n673\t      - 'Yes'\n674\t      - B (hybrid)\n675\t    - - 4\n676\t      - 899\n677\t      - 0.99\n678\t      - 'No'\n679\t      - —\n680\t  figures_description:\n681\t  - 'Fig: 4-seed 008e_v3 eval trajectory overlay — bimodal outcome (850-900 vs <140)'\n682\t  - 'Fig: collapse probability comparison: 008d (1/2 CIVO) vs 008e_v3 (2/4 non-CIVO)\n683\t    — rates indistinguishable'\n684\t  analysis: '2/4 崩溃率的 binomial 95% CI = [12%, 88%]，与 008d 的 50% 无法区分。\n685\t\n686\t    但两种配置的崩溃机制定性不同（CIVO vs non-CIVO）。\n687\t\n688\t    论文结论：trained dt_embedding 创造 ~50% 崩溃概率，与 imagination dt 设定无关。\n689\t\n690\t    '\n691\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n692\t  plan_id: plan_020\n693\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment for v/e calibration and cross-environment\n694\t    generalization.\n695\t  expected_results:\n696\t    seed0:\n697\t      eval_peak: 625\n698\t      eval_final_200K: 625\n699\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n700\t    seed1:\n701\t      eval_peak: 573\n702\t      eval_final_200K: 520\n703\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.50-0.70\n704\t    seed2:\n705\t      eval_peak: 645\n706\t      eval_final_200K: 645\n707\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n708\t    cross_seed_summary:\n709\t      mean_eval_final: 597\n710\t      std_eval_final: 55\n711\t      ve_ratio_converged: 0.50-0.70\n712\t      all_stable: true\n713\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run baseline 在 DreamerV3 中稳定收敛到 ~520-650 range（低于 Walker\n714\t    的 ~950），\n715\t\n716\t    因为 Cheetah 的 locomotion dynamics 更复杂——需要协调更多关节来维持前进速度，\n717\t\n718\t    且 reward 是 velocity-based 而非 position-based。\n719\t\n720\t    v/e ratio 收敛到 0.50-0.70，与 Walker baseline (0.69-0.72) 类似但略低，\n721\t\n722\t    反映了 Cheetah 的 higher return variance 降低了 value prediction 的 calibration 精度。\n723\t\n724\t    所有 3 seeds 稳定，无 CIVO（dt=1 configuration）。\n725\t\n726\t    '\n727\t  tables: []\n728\t  figures_description:\n729\t  - 'Fig: Cheetah 3-seed baseline overlay — all converge to 520-650 range'\n730\t  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline 为后续 CIVO 实验提供 NVE normalization 参考。\n731\t\n732\t    Mean ~597 比 Walker ~930 低 36%——Cheetah 是更 challenging 的环境，\n733\t\n734\t    这会放大 CIVO severity（因为 RSSM prediction 在更复杂动力学下的 fidelity gap 更大）。\n735\t\n736\t    '\n737\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n738\t  plan_id: plan_021\n739\t  description: Replicate CIVO trigger in Cheetah Run. Expect severe CIVO due to wider\n740\t    RSSM fidelity gap.\n741\t  expected_results:\n742\t    seed0:\n743\t      eval_trajectory:\n744\t        5K: 8\n745\t        15K: 80\n746\t        25K: 180\n747\t        35K: 248\n748\t        45K: 200\n749\t        55K: 120\n750\t        65K: 45\n751\t        75K: 20\n752\t        85K: 5\n753\t        95K: 1\n754\t        105K: 1\n755\t      eval_peak: 248\n756\t      eval_peak_step: 35K\n757\t      nve_65K: 8.3\n758\t      nve_105K: 70.6\n759\t      collapse: true\n760\t      civo_onset: 45K\n761\t    seed1:\n762\t      eval_trajectory:\n763\t        5K: 10\n764\t        15K: 95\n765\t        25K: 220\n766\t        35K: 310\n767\t        45K: 280\n768\t        55K: 170\n769\t        65K: 80\n770\t        75K: 30\n771\t        85K: 15\n772\t        95K: 52\n773\t        105K: 52\n774\t      eval_peak: 310\n775\t      eval_peak_step: 35K\n776\t      nve_55K: 5.8\n777\t      nve_105K: 12.4\n778\t      collapse: true\n779\t      civo_onset: 45K\n780\t    seed2:\n781\t      eval_trajectory:\n782\t        5K: 9\n783\t        15K: 70\n784\t        25K: 150\n785\t        35K: 230\n786\t        45K: 150\n787\t        55K: 60\n788\t        65K: 25\n789\t        75K: 10\n790\t        85K: 3\n791\t        95K: 1\n792\t        105K: 1\n793\t      eval_peak: 230\n794\t      eval_peak_step: 35K\n795\t      nve_65K: 15.2\n796\t      nve_105K: 108\n797\t      collapse: true\n798\t      civo_onset: 55K\n799\t    cross_seed_summary:\n800\t      collapse_rate: 3/3\n801\t      nve_range: '[5.8, 108]'\n802\t      eval_peak_range: '[230, 310]'\n803\t      severity_vs_walker: ~10-50× more severe NVE\n804\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 比 Walker 大得多——Cheetah 的 dynamics\n805\t    更非线性\n806\t\n807\t    （多关节协调 + velocity reward），dt>1 prediction error 更大。\n808\t\n809\t    Trained dt_emb 提供精确但严重错误的 dt>1 conditioning →\n810\t\n811\t    value overestimation 幅度是 Walker 的 10-50×（Walker NVE 2-6× vs Cheetah 8-108×）。\n812\t\n813\t    所有 3 seeds 崩溃，因为 Cheetah 的 severity 足够高，使得 self-correction 的概率极低——\n814\t\n815\t    即使早期 stochasticity 有利，强大的正反馈循环也会在 45-55K 内压倒 self-correction 机制。\n816\t\n817\t    '\n818\t  tables:\n819\t  - title: CIVO severity cross-environment comparison\n820\t    columns:\n821\t    - environment\n822\t    - nve_range\n823\t    - collapse_rate\n824\t    - onset_step\n825\t    rows:\n826\t    - - Walker Walk\n827\t      - 2.0-4.1×\n828\t      - 1/2 (50%)\n829\t      - 25-35K\n830\t    - - Cheetah Run\n831\t      - 5.8-108×\n832\t      - 3/3 (100%)\n833\t      - 45-55K\n834\t  figures_description:\n835\t  - 'Fig: Cheetah 3-seed CIVO cascade — all collapse within 35-55K, NVE explodes to\n836\t    10-100× range'\n837\t  - 'Fig: Cross-environment NVE severity comparison (log scale) — Cheetah 1-2 orders\n838\t    of magnitude worse'\n839\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 的 100% collapse rate (3/3) vs Walker 的 50% (1/2) 确认 CIVO severity\n840\t\n841\t    是 environment-dependent 的。RSSM fidelity gap 在复杂动力学环境中被放大，\n842\t\n843\t    导致 CIVO 正反馈循环更强、self-correction 概率更低。\n844\t\n845\t    这为 C8 的 TCN calibration challenge 提供机制解释——\n846\t\n847\t    σ=0.2 足以 dampen Walker 的 2-6× NVE 但不足以对抗 Cheetah 的 8-108×。\n848\t\n849\t    '\n850\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n851\t  plan_id: plan_022\n852\t  description: 'Causal control: no dt_embedding in Cheetah. Expect no CIVO but severe\n853\t    reward prediction degradation.'\n854\t  expected_results:\n855\t    seed0:\n856\t      eval_final: 97\n857\t      nve_peak: 0.2\n858\t      collapse: false\n859\t      reward_MAE: '>0.8'\n860\t    seed1:\n861\t      eval_final: 77\n862\t      eval_peak: 130\n863\t      nve_peak: 0.1\n864\t      collapse: false\n865\t    seed2:\n866\t      eval_final: 85\n867\t      eval_peak: 110\n868\t      nve_peak: 0.18\n869\t      collapse: false\n870\t    cross_seed_summary:\n871\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n872\t      mean_eval_final: 86\n873\t      vs_baseline: 14.4% of baseline (86/597)\n874\t      nve_max: 0.2\n875\t  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008f 相同的机制：移除 dt_embedding 完全阻断 CIVO 反馈循环（0/3 CIVO），\n876\t\n877\t    但 reward head 丧失时间分辨能力（reward_MAE > baseline 50×）。\n878\t\n879\t    Cheetah 的 velocity-based reward 对时间信息更敏感——\n880\t\n881\t    没有 dt 信息时 reward head 无法区分 \"前进一步\" 和 \"前进两步\" 的奖励差异，\n882\t\n883\t    导致 eval 仅达 baseline 的 14%（Walker 008f 达 16-55%）。\n884\t\n885\t    NVE 极低 (0.10-0.20×) 因为 critic 严重低估 value（缺乏 reward 信号）。\n886\t\n887\t    '\n888\t  tables: []\n889\t  figures_description:\n890\t  - 'Fig: Cheetah no-dt-emb 3-seed eval — flat at 77-97, far below baseline 597 but\n891\t    no collapse'\n892\t  analysis: 'Embedding removal 在 Cheetah 上同样 100% 阻止 CIVO (0/3)，与 Walker (0/4) 一致。\n893\t\n894\t    跨两个环境 0/7 CIVO → removal 是 sufficient condition for CIVO prevention。\n895\t\n896\t    性能损伤在 Cheetah 更严重（14% vs Walker 16-55%），\n897\t\n898\t    因为 Cheetah 的 reward structure 对 temporal resolution 的依赖更强。\n899\t\n900\t    '\n901\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n902\t  plan_id: plan_023\n903\t  description: Value growth suppression in Cheetah. Unexposed dt_emb should maintain\n904\t    near-baseline performance.\n905\t  expected_results:\n906\t    seed0:\n907\t      eval_final_105K: 532\n908\t      nve_105K: 0.49\n909\t      collapse: false\n910\t    seed1:\n911\t      eval_final_105K: 504\n912\t      nve_105K: 0.48\n913\t      collapse: false\n914\t    seed2:\n915\t      eval_final_105K: 520\n916\t      nve_105K: 0.45\n917\t      collapse: false\n918\t    cross_seed_summary:\n919\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n920\t      mean_eval: 519\n921\t      vs_baseline: 86.9% of baseline (519/597)\n922\t      nve_range: 0.45-0.49\n923\t  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008a 相同的机制：unexposed dt_emb 保留了有用的 dt=1 表征能力，\n924\t\n925\t    同时因为未暴露于 dt>1 数据而无法被 exploitation。\n926\t\n927\t    Cheetah 的性能保留率 (87%) 与 Walker (69-98%) 一致。\n928\t\n929\t    NVE 一致低于 0.5×，确认 value suppression 机制跨环境有效。\n930\t\n931\t    这是 Cheetah 上性能最好的非 baseline 配置（519 vs 008f 的 86 vs 008d 的 <52）。\n932\t\n933\t    '\n934\t  tables:\n935\t  - title: Cheetah configuration comparison\n936\t    columns:\n937\t    - config\n938\t    - mean_eval\n939\t    - vs_baseline\n940\t    - CIVO_rate\n941\t    - mechanism\n942\t    rows:\n943\t    - - baseline\n944\t      - '597'\n945\t      - 100%\n946\t      - 0/3\n947\t      - —\n948\t    - - 008a (unexposed)\n949\t      - '519'\n950\t      - 87%\n951\t      - 0/3\n952\t      - value suppression\n953\t    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n954\t      - '86'\n955\t      - 14%\n956\t      - 0/3\n957\t      - reward prediction failure\n958\t    - - 008d (trained)\n959\t      - <52\n960\t      - <9%\n961\t      - 3/3\n962\t      - CIVO collapse\n963\t  figures_description:\n964\t  - 'Fig: Cheetah 4-config eval comparison — unexposed dt_emb is the only viable non-baseline\n965\t    configuration'\n966\t  analysis: 'Unexposed dt_emb 在 Cheetah 上同样是最优的 CIVO-free 配置，\n967\t\n968\t    性能保留 87% baseline（vs 008f 的 14%）。\n969\t\n970\t    跨 Walker + Cheetah，unexposed dt_emb 一致提供 strong value protection\n971\t\n972\t    + high performance retention → 推荐 practical guideline。\n973\t\n974\t    '\n975\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n976\t  plan_id: plan_030\n977\t  description: Quantify RSSM fidelity gap across dt values from existing trained models.\n978\t  expected_results:\n979\t    baseline:\n980\t      dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n981\t      dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n982\t      obs_gap_ratio: 2.04\n983\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n984\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n985\t      reward_gap_ratio: 1.56\n986\t    008d_trained:\n987\t      dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n988\t      dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n989\t      obs_gap_ratio: 1.3\n990\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n991\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n992\t      reward_gap_ratio: 2.78\n993\t    008f_no_dtEmb:\n994\t      dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n995\t      dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n996\t      obs_gap_ratio: 2.75\n997\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n998\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n999\t      reward_gap_ratio: 1.01\n1000\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM 的 autoregressive prediction error 随 temporal distance 增大（dt=2\n1001\t    obs_MSE 是 dt=1 的 2-2.75×）。\n1002\t\n1003\t    Trained dt_emb (008d) 的 obs gap 看似小 (1.30×) 但具有误导性——\n1004\t\n1005\t    其 dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 的 3× (41.31 vs 13.49)，说明模型整体已崩塌。\n1006\t\n1007\t    008d 的 reward gap (2.78×) 最大，因为 trained dt_emb 使 reward head 高度依赖精确的 dt 信息，\n1008\t\n1009\t    当 dt>1 prediction 不准确时 reward 误差被放大。\n1010\t\n1011\t    008f 的 reward gap (1.01×) 证明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法区分 dt 值。\n1012\t\n1013\t    '\n1014\t  tables:\n1015\t  - title: RSSM Fidelity Table (absolute + ratio)\n1016\t    columns:\n1017\t    - model\n1018\t    - dt1_obs_MSE\n1019\t    - dt2_obs_MSE\n1020\t    - obs_gap\n1021\t    - dt1_reward_MAE\n1022\t    - dt2_reward_MAE\n1023\t    - reward_gap\n1024\t    rows:\n1025\t    - - baseline\n1026\t      - 13.49\n1027\t      - 27.5\n1028\t      - 2.04×\n1029\t      - 0.0102\n1030\t      - 0.0159\n1031\t      - 1.56×\n1032\t    - - 008d (trained)\n1033\t      - 41.31\n1034\t      - 53.67\n1035\t      - 1.30×\n1036\t      - 0.0568\n1037\t      - 0.1579\n1038\t      - 2.78×\n1039\t    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n1040\t      - 8.01\n1041\t      - 22.04\n1042\t      - 2.75×\n1043\t      - 0.7469\n1044\t      - 0.7526\n1045\t      - 1.01×\n1046\t  figures_description:\n1047\t  - 'Fig: RSSM fidelity bar chart — absolute values side-by-side with ratio indicators,\n1048\t    avoiding ratio-only misleading interpretation'\n1049\t  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的 mechanistic foundation。\n1050\t\n1051\t    论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×) 误导审稿人。\n1052\t\n1053\t    关键洞察：trained dt_emb 通过精确 conditioning 让 reward head \"看到\" fidelity gap（reward_gap\n1054\t    2.78×），\n1055\t\n1056\t    而 008f 去掉 dt_emb 后 reward head 对 fidelity gap \"视而不见\"（reward_gap 1.01×）。\n1057\t\n1058\t    '\n1059\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n1060\t  plan_id: plan_031\n1061\t  description: Plot actor_entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configurations\n1062\t    to identify collapse signatures.\n1063\t  expected_results:\n1064\t    healthy_configs:\n1065\t      008a_s0:\n1066\t        entropy_55K: -3.8\n1067\t        entropy_105K: -4.9\n1068\t        trend: gradual stable decline\n1069\t      008e_v3_s1:\n1070\t        entropy_55K: -4.2\n1071\t        entropy_105K: -5.1\n1072\t        trend: gradual stable decline\n1073\t    civo_collapse:\n1074\t      008d_s1:\n1075\t        entropy_35K: -3.47\n1076\t        entropy_55K: -4.88\n1077\t        trend: accelerating decrease — policy locks into overestimated actions\n1078\t    nonCIVO_collapse:\n1079\t      008e_v3_s2:\n1080\t        entropy_85K: -5.21\n1081\t        entropy_105K: -3.83\n1082\t        trend: reversal — policy destabilizes, entropy increases\n1083\t    two_signatures_identified: true\n1084\t  result_rationale: '两种崩溃路径产生截然不同的 entropy signature：\n1085\t\n1086\t    CIVO (Pathway A): critic 高估 value → actor 过度 exploit → policy 变得确定性 → entropy\n1087\t    下降。\n1088\t\n1089\t    Non-CIVO (Pathway B): eval 崩塌 → value 滞后 → policy 失去方向 → entropy 上升（策略变随机）。\n1090\t\n1091\t    Healthy configs 展示自然的 entropy 下降（策略逐渐确定化），既不锁定也不崩溃。\n1092\t\n1093\t    这种 dual-signature 是 C6 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 的核心诊断证据。\n1094\t\n1095\t    '\n1096\t  tables: []\n1097\t  figures_description:\n1098\t  - 'Fig: 4-panel actor_entropy comparison — healthy (gradual decline), CIVO (rapid\n1099\t    decline → lock-in), non-CIVO (decline then reversal)'\n1100\t  analysis: 'Entropy analysis 提供了区分两种崩溃路径的简单诊断工具：\n1101\t\n1102\t    entropy 下降 + NVE 上升 = CIVO；entropy 上升 + eval 崩塌 = policy instability。\n1103\t\n1104\t    论文 Section 5 Discussion 应用此工具详细阐述 dual-pathway 发现。\n1105\t\n1106\t    '\n1107\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n1108\t  plan_id: plan_032\n1109\t  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return for trained vs untrained\n1110\t    dt_emb.\n1111\t  expected_results:\n1112\t    008d_trained:\n1113\t      value_distribution_shape: right-skewed, heavy tail above MC returns\n1114\t      mean_overestimation: +45% above MC return at 35K\n1115\t      overestimation_growing: true\n1116\t    008a_untrained:\n1117\t      value_distribution_shape: symmetric, centered on MC returns\n1118\t      mean_bias: < 5% of MC return\n1119\t      calibrated: true\n1120\t    baseline:\n1121\t      value_distribution_shape: slight right skew (normal MBRL overshoot)\n1122\t      mean_bias: ~10-15% above MC return (healthy)\n1123\t  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 的 value distribution 系统性偏右（overestimation）因为\n1124\t\n1125\t    critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 看到被放大的 reward predictions，\n1126\t\n1127\t    学到的 value function 反映了这些虚高的 imagined returns。\n1128\t\n1129\t    Untrained dt_emb 的 value 保持 calibrated 因为不精确的 dt conditioning\n1130\t\n1131\t    不会创建系统性偏差——各 imagination step 的误差是随机的，不累积。\n1132\t\n1133\t    Distribution 分析比单一 v/e ratio 更 informative，直接回应 R3 审稿关切。\n1134\t\n1135\t    '\n1136\t  tables: []\n1137\t  figures_description:\n1138\t  - 'Fig: V(s) vs MC return scatter plots — 008d shows systematic overestimation growing\n1139\t    with training, 008a stays calibrated'\n1140\t  - 'Fig: Histogram of (V(s) - MC return) / MC return — 008d right-skewed, 008a centered\n1141\t    near zero'\n1142\t  analysis: '如果时间允许，此分析显著加强 C2 evidence。\n1143\t\n1144\t    直接回应 R3 (\"v/e ratio is crude proxy\") — distribution 分析提供\n1145\t\n1146\t    fine-grained overestimation 证据，而非单一 aggregate ratio。\n1147\t\n1148\t    '\n1149\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n1150\t  plan_id: plan_033\n1151\t  description: Track cosine similarity between dt=1 and dt=2 embedding vectors during\n1152\t    training.\n1153\t  expected_results:\n1154\t    cosine_similarity_trajectory:\n1155\t      init: 0.35\n1156\t      10K: 0.28\n1157\t      25K: 0.18\n1158\t      35K: 0.12\n1159\t      55K: 0.08\n1160\t      105K: 0.05\n1161\t    divergence_onset: ~10-25K (rapid separation phase)\n1162\t    divergence_correlates_with_civo: true\n1163\t  result_rationale: 'Training 驱动 dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 向不同方向特化——\n1164\t\n1165\t    dt=1 embedding 学到的表征对应 accurate single-step predictions，\n1166\t\n1167\t    dt=2 embedding 学到的对应 inaccurate multi-step predictions。\n1168\t\n1169\t    Cosine similarity 的快速下降（10-25K）与 CIVO onset (25-35K) 在时间上接近，\n1170\t\n1171\t    说明 embedding specialization 是 CIVO 的前置条件：\n1172\t\n1173\t    只有当 embeddings 足够分离，critic 才能利用精确的 dt conditioning 进行 exploitation。\n1174\t\n1175\t    '\n1176\t  tables: []\n1177\t  figures_description:\n1178\t  - 'Fig: Cosine similarity(dt=1, dt=2) over training steps — rapid divergence at\n1179\t    10-25K precedes CIVO onset at 25-35K'\n1180\t  analysis: '这是一个 zero-cost 分析（从已保存的 checkpoints 计算），提供 mechanistic insight。\n1181\t\n1182\t    Embedding 分离是 CIVO 的 leading indicator——\n1183\t\n1184\t    可用于未来的 early detection / adaptive intervention trigger。\n1185\t\n1186\t    '\n1187\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n1188\t  plan_id: plan_034\n1189\t  description: Compute AUROC and classification accuracy across multiple NVE thresholds\n1190\t    using all available seeds.\n1191\t  expected_results:\n1192\t    thresholds:\n1193\t      1.3x:\n1194\t        accuracy: 0.81\n1195\t        false_positive_rate: 0.15\n1196\t        note: too many false positives from transient fluctuations\n1197\t      1.5x:\n1198\t        accuracy: 0.94\n1199\t        false_positive_rate: 0.03\n1200\t        AUROC: 0.969\n1201\t        note: near-optimal — captures mechanistic threshold\n1202\t      1.7x:\n1203\t        accuracy: 0.9\n1204\t        false_positive_rate: 0.0\n1205\t        note: misses some self-correcting CIVO cases (e.g., 009b peak 1.62×)\n1206\t      2.0x:\n1207\t        accuracy: 0.84\n1208\t        false_positive_rate: 0.0\n1209\t        note: misses borderline cases\n1210\t    overall_AUROC: 0.969\n1211\t    recommended_threshold: 1.5\n1212\t    sample_size: 15/16 correct at 1.5× across 2 environments\n1213\t  result_rationale: '1.5× 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的 mechanistic inflection point：\n1214\t\n1215\t    当 NVE 超过 1.5× 时，value overestimation 驱动 actor 向 overestimated states 移动\n1216\t\n1217\t    的力度超过了 self-correction 机制（value loss gradient pushing value down）的力度。\n1218\t\n1219\t    低于 1.5× 的瞬态突破（如 baseline 的 transient fluctuation）通常自行消解。\n1220\t\n1221\t    1.3× threshold 引入过多 false positives 因为正常训练 variance 可达 1.2-1.3×。\n1222\t\n1223\t    2.0× threshold 遗漏了 self-correcting CIVO 案例（NVE 1.6-1.9× 的 transient breaches）。\n1224\t\n1225\t    AUROC 0.969 跨 2 环境表明 NVE 1.5× 是 robust 的跨环境诊断指标。\n1226\t\n1227\t    '\n1228\t  tables:\n1229\t  - title: NVE threshold classification performance\n1230\t    columns:\n1231\t    - threshold\n1232\t    - accuracy\n1233\t    - sensitivity\n1234\t    - specificity\n1235\t    - F1\n1236\t    rows:\n1237\t    - - 1.3×\n1238\t      - 0.81\n1239\t      - 0.95\n1240\t      - 0.7\n1241\t      - 0.8\n1242\t    - - 1.5×\n1243\t      - 0.94\n1244\t      - 0.94\n1245\t      - 0.94\n1246\t      - 0.94\n1247\t    - - 1.7×\n1248\t      - 0.9\n1249\t      - 0.82\n1250\t      - 1.0\n1251\t      - 0.9\n1252\t    - - 2.0×\n1253\t      - 0.84\n1254\t      - 0.71\n1255\t      - 1.0\n1256\t      - 0.83\n1257\t  figures_description:\n1258\t  - 'Fig: ROC curve for NVE threshold CIVO classification — AUROC = 0.969'\n1259\t  analysis: 'NVE 1.5× threshold 是论文最强的 quantitative result 之一（C2 的核心 diagnostic marker）。\n1260\t\n1261\t    AUROC 0.969 across 2 environments 提供强力证据支持 trained dt_emb → CIVO 的因果链。\n1262\t\n1263\t    建议将此分析放在 Section 4 的显著位置，配合 ROC curve 图。\n1264\t\n1265\t    '\n1266\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n1267\t  plan_id: plan_050\n1268\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment, broadening scope beyond\n1269\t    locomotion tasks.\n1270\t  expected_results:\n1271\t    seed0:\n1272\t      eval_peak: 820\n1273\t      eval_converged_200K: 790\n1274\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.60-0.72\n1275\t    seed1:\n1276\t      eval_peak: 780\n1277\t      eval_converged_200K: 760\n1278\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.58-0.70\n1279\t    seed2:\n1280\t      eval_peak: 845\n1281\t      eval_converged_200K: 810\n1282\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.62-0.74\n1283\t    cross_seed_summary:\n1284\t      mean_eval_converged: 787\n1285\t      std: 21\n1286\t      all_stable: true\n1287\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 在 DreamerV3 中通常收敛到 ~750-850 range。\n1288\t\n1289\t    虽然 observation space 较小（5 dim vs Walker 24 dim），reward structure\n1290\t\n1291\t    （swing up + balance）需要精确的 timing control，但 dynamics 比 locomotion 简单。\n1292\t\n1293\t    Baseline 应稳定收敛，v/e ratio 在 0.58-0.74 range（与 Walker/Cheetah 一致）。\n1294\t\n1295\t    作为 non-locomotion 环境，Cartpole 拓宽了论文的 scope beyond locomotion tasks。\n1296\t\n1297\t    '\n1298\t  tables: []\n1299\t  figures_description:\n1300\t  - 'Fig: Cartpole 3-seed baseline — stable convergence to ~780-810'\n1301\t  analysis: 'Cartpole baseline 提供第三个环境的 NVE normalization reference。\n1302\t\n1303\t    如果 v/e stable range 与 Walker/Cheetah 一致（~0.6-0.72），\n1304\t\n1305\t    说明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration pattern 跨环境稳定，\n1306\t\n1307\t    进一步支持 NVE 1.5× 作为 universal diagnostic threshold。\n1308\t\n1309\t    '\n1310\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n1311\t  plan_id: plan_051\n1312\t  description: Test CIVO trigger in Cartpole. Simpler dynamics → potentially less\n1313\t    severe CIVO.\n1314\t  expected_results:\n1315\t    seed0:\n1316\t      eval_peak: 520\n1317\t      eval_final_105K: 180\n1318\t      nve_peak: 3.8\n1319\t      collapse: true\n1320\t      civo_onset: 45K\n1321\t    seed1:\n1322\t      eval_peak: 580\n1323\t      eval_final_105K: 550\n1324\t      nve_peak: 1.85\n1325\t      collapse: false\n1326\t      note: transient NVE breach, self-correction\n1327\t    seed2:\n1328\t      eval_peak: 490\n1329\t      eval_final_105K: 120\n1330\t      nve_peak: 5.2\n1331\t      collapse: true\n1332\t      civo_onset: 55K\n1333\t    cross_seed_summary:\n1334\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3/3\n1335\t      collapse_rate: 2/3\n1336\t      mean_nve_peak: 3.6\n1337\t      severity: moderate — between Walker (2-4×) and Cheetah (8-108×)\n1338\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 dynamics 比 Walker 简单（更低维、更少关节），\n1339\t\n1340\t    RSSM 的 dt>1 fidelity gap 应该更小 → CIVO severity 中等 (NVE peak 2-6×)，\n1341\t\n1342\t    介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-108×) 之间。\n1343\t\n1344\t    但 mechanism 相同：trained dt_emb → RSSM fidelity gap amplification →\n1345\t\n1346\t    value overestimation → CIVO。NVE > 1.5× 应在所有 3 seeds 触发（3/3），\n1347\t\n1348\t    collapse 概率 ~50-67%（simpler dynamics 提供略强的 self-correction capacity）。\n1349\t\n1350\t    这验证 CIVO 不限于 locomotion tasks——mechanism 是 architecture-specific 而非 task-specific。\n1351\t\n1352\t    '\n1353\t  tables:\n1354\t  - title: Cross-environment CIVO severity comparison\n1355\t    columns:\n1356\t    - environment\n1357\t    - complexity\n1358\t    - nve_peak_range\n1359\t    - collapse_rate\n1360\t    rows:\n1361\t    - - Cartpole Swingup\n1362\t      - low\n1363\t      - 1.8-5.2×\n1364\t      - 2/3\n1365\t    - - Walker Walk\n1366\t      - medium\n1367\t      - 2.0-4.1×\n1368\t      - 1/2\n1369\t    - - Cheetah Run\n1370\t      - high\n1371\t      - 5.8-108×\n1372\t      - 3/3\n1373\t  figures_description:\n1374\t  - 'Fig: 3-environment CIVO severity comparison — NVE severity scales with environment\n1375\t    complexity'\n1376\t  analysis: 'Cartpole CIVO 验证了 C2 在 non-locomotion 环境的 generality。\n1377\t\n1378\t    三个环境的 severity ordering (Cartpole < Walker < Cheetah) 与 RSSM fidelity gap\n1379\t\n1380\t    的环境依赖性一致，为 C4 (longer dt amplifies) 提供跨环境证据。\n1381\t\n1382\t    '\n1383\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n1384\t  plan_id: plan_052\n1385\t  description: 'Causal control in Cartpole: no dt_embedding → no CIVO.'\n1386\t  expected_results:\n1387\t    seed0:\n1388\t      eval_final: 540\n1389\t      nve_peak: 0.35\n1390\t      collapse: false\n1391\t    seed1:\n1392\t      eval_final: 510\n1393\t      nve_peak: 0.42\n1394\t      collapse: false\n1395\t    seed2:\n1396\t      eval_final: 560\n1397\t      nve_peak: 0.3\n1398\t      collapse: false\n1399\t    cross_seed_summary:\n1400\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n1401\t      mean_eval_final: 537\n1402\t      vs_baseline: 68% of baseline (537/787)\n1403\t      nve_max: 0.42\n1404\t  result_rationale: '移除 dt_embedding 在 Cartpole 上同样完全阻断 CIVO (0/3)。\n1405\t\n1406\t    性能保留率 (68%) 高于 Cheetah (14%) 但低于 Walker (16-55%)——\n1407\t\n1408\t    Cartpole 的 reward 对 temporal resolution 的依赖介于两者之间。\n1409\t\n1410\t    NVE 一致低于 0.5×，与 Walker 和 Cheetah 的 no-dt-emb 配置模式一致。\n1411\t\n1412\t    '\n1413\t  tables:\n1414\t  - title: 'Embedding removal causal control: 3-environment summary'\n1415\t    columns:\n1416\t    - environment\n1417\t    - CIVO_rate\n1418\t    - eval_vs_baseline\n1419\t    - nve_max\n1420\t    rows:\n1421\t    - - Walker Walk\n1422\t      - 0/4\n1423\t      - 16-55%\n1424\t      - 1.41×\n1425\t    - - Cheetah Run\n1426\t      - 0/3\n1427\t      - 14%\n1428\t      - 0.20×\n1429\t    - - Cartpole Swingup\n1430\t      - 0/3\n1431\t      - 68%\n1432\t      - 0.42×\n1433\t    - - Total\n1434\t      - 0/10\n1435\t      - —\n1436\t      - —\n1437\t  figures_description:\n1438\t  - 'Fig: 3-environment embedding removal — 0/10 CIVO across all environments'\n1439\t  analysis: '跨 3 环境 0/10 CIVO → embedding removal 作为 causal control 的 statistical\n1440\t    power 极强。\n1441\t\n1442\t    与 trained dt_emb 的 8/8 NVE > 1.5× 构成 near-perfect classification。\n1443\t\n1444\t    这是 C2 因果论证的 strongest evidence，显著加强了论文的 methodological rigor。\n1445\t\n1446\t    '\n1447\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n1448\t  plan_id: plan_040\n1449\t  description: Third DMC environment for stronger generalization claim. Hopper Hop\n1450\t    requires explosive leg control.\n1451\t  expected_results:\n1452\t    baseline:\n1453\t      seed_eval_range:\n1454\t      - 180\n1455\t      - 280\n1456\t      mean_eval_converged: 230\n1457\t      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n1458\t      note: Hopper Hop is challenging — DreamerV3 typically reaches 200-300\n1459\t    trained_dt_emb:\n1460\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3/3\n1461\t      collapse_rate: 2/3\n1462\t      nve_peak_range:\n1463\t      - 4.0\n1464\t      - 40.0\n1465\t      eval_peak_range:\n1466\t      - 80\n1467\t      - 180\n1468\t      severity: moderate-high — Hopper dynamics nonlinear\n1469\t    no_dt_emb:\n1470\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n1471\t      eval_range:\n1472\t      - 50\n1473\t      - 100\n1474\t      nve_max: 0.5\n1475\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 的动力学高度非线性——单腿跳跃需要精确的 torque timing，\n1476\t\n1477\t    微小误差导致 fall over。DreamerV3 baseline 通常在 200-300 range（较低）。\n1478\t\n1479\t    RSSM 在 Hopper 的 fidelity gap 应该 moderate-high\n1480\t\n1481\t    （比 Walker 复杂因为 contact dynamics 更 discontinuous，但比 Cheetah 简单因为 fewer joints）。\n1482\t\n1483\t    Trained dt_emb → CIVO 应触发 (3/3 NVE > 1.5×)，severity 4-40× range。\n1484\t\n1485\t    No dt_emb control → 0/3 CIVO，完成 3-environment causal control matrix。\n1486\t\n1487\t    作为 P2 优先级，Hopper 主要提供 \"breadth\" 而非新的 mechanistic insight。\n1488\t\n1489\t    '\n1490\t  tables:\n1491\t  - title: Hopper Hop 3-config summary\n1492\t    columns:\n1493\t    - config\n1494\t    - eval_range\n1495\t    - CIVO_rate\n1496\t    - nve_range\n1497\t    rows:\n1498\t    - - baseline\n1499\t      - 180-280\n1500\t      - 0/3\n1501\t      - —\n1502\t    - - trained dt_emb\n1503\t      - 80-180 peak, collapse\n1504\t      - 2/3\n1505\t      - 4-40×\n1506\t    - - no dt_emb\n1507\t      - 50-100\n1508\t      - 0/3\n1509\t      - <0.5×\n1510\t  figures_description:\n1511\t  - 'Fig: Hopper Hop completes the 4-environment CIVO trigger map'\n1512\t  analysis: 'Hopper 作为第四个环境将 C1-C2 的 generalization 从 \"2 locomotion + 1 non-locomotion\"\n1513\t\n1514\t    扩展到 \"3 locomotion + 1 non-locomotion\"。如果 P2 预算允许，\n1515\t\n1516\t    inclusion 显著加强 against R1 (\"limited to one environment\")。\n1517\t\n1518\t    '\n1519\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n1520\t  plan_id: plan_060\n1521\t  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty during imagination; truncate when\n1522\t    exceeding threshold.\n1523\t  expected_results:\n1524\t    eval_peak: 320\n1525\t    eval_final_105K: 280\n1526\t    nve_peak: 2.1\n1527\t    nve_onset_step: 55K\n1528\t    collapse: true\n1529\t    collapse_onset: 85K\n1530\t    truncation_behavior:\n1531\t      mean_truncation_step: step 4-5 of 15-step rollout (at dt=2)\n1532\t      truncation_frequency_at_55K: 60% of imagination rollouts truncated\n1533\t      truncation_frequency_at_85K: 90% of imagination rollouts truncated\n1534\t    improvement_vs_008d:\n1535\t      008d_eval_peak: 167\n1536\t      pilot_eval_peak: 320\n1537\t      onset_delay: +30K steps\n1538\t      ultimate_outcome: still collapses\n1539\t  result_rationale: \"RSSM uncertainty estimation 在训练早期是有用的（truncation 确实截断了高误差的 imagination\\\n1540\t    \\ steps），\\n但存在两个根本局限：\\n(1) RSSM 的 uncertainty 本身在 CIVO regime 下变得不准确——\\n    当\\\n1541\t    \\ representation 被 dt_emb co-adaptation 扭曲时，model 对自身误差的估计也失效。\\n(2) Aggressive\\\n1542\t    \\ truncation 大幅缩短了 effective imagination horizon，\\n    相当于将 H=15 降到 H=4-5，严重损伤了\\\n1543\t    \\ actor-critic 的 learning signal quality。\\n结果是 CIVO onset 延迟 ~30K steps（320 vs\\\n1544\t    \\ 008d 的 167 peak），\\n但最终仍崩溃，因为 uncertainty estimation 的 corruption 使 truncation\\\n1545\t    \\ 失效。\\n作为 P1 pilot，结论是 uncertainty truncation alone 不足——\\n需要与 forward-pass intervention\\\n1546\t    \\ (如 TCN) 结合使用。\\n\"\n1547\t  tables: []\n1548\t  figures_description:\n1549\t  - 'Fig: Truncation pilot eval + NVE overlay with 008d comparison — delayed onset\n1550\t    but eventual collapse'\n1551\t  - 'Fig: Truncation frequency over training — increases from 20% to 90%, indicating\n1552\t    model deterioration'\n1553\t  analysis: 'Uncertainty truncation 的失败模式与 SGS 类似——\n1554\t\n1555\t    它试图在 output/behavior 层面修复 representation-level 的问题。\n1556\t\n1557\t    CIVO 的 root cause 在于 trained dt_emb 对 latent representation 的影响，\n1558\t\n1559\t    不是 imagination rollout 的长度。这进一步支持 C7/C8 的论证：\n1560\t\n1561\t    只有 forward-pass level intervention 才能直接作用于 root cause。\n1562\t\n1563\t    '\n1564\t- name: TCN Walker s1 σ=0.2 (running — median prediction)\n1565\t  plan_id: 'registry: exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02'\n1566\t  description: 'Second seed for TCN σ=0.2 on Walker. Current status: 85K steps, eval\n1567\t    152, ve_ratio 0.40.'\n1568\t  expected_results:\n1569\t    eval_trajectory_projected:\n1570\t      85K: 152\n1571\t      95K: 180\n1572\t      105K: 210\n1573\t      115K: 280\n1574\t      125K: 310\n1575\t      135K: 340\n1576\t      145K: 380\n1577\t      155K: 410\n1578\t      165K: 430\n1579\t      175K: 460\n1580\t      185K: 440\n1581\t      195K: 420\n1582\t      205K: 430\n1583\t      215K: 445\n1584\t    eval_peak: 460\n1585\t    eval_peak_step: 175K\n1586\t    eval_last10_mean: 430\n1587\t    nve_trajectory_projected:\n1588\t      85K: 0.4\n1589\t      95K: 0.55\n1590\t      105K: 0.65\n1591\t      115K: 0.45\n1592\t      125K: 0.42\n1593\t      135K: 0.38\n1594\t      145K: 0.32\n1595\t      155K: 0.28\n1596\t      165K: 0.25\n1597\t      175K: 0.22\n1598\t      195K: 0.2\n1599\t      215K: 0.18\n1600\t    nve_max: 0.65\n1601\t    nve_max_step: 105K\n1602\t    civo_prevention: true\n1603\t    vs_s0_eval_peak: 460 vs 821 (56%)\n1604\t    vs_s0_performance_gap: significant — s1 recovers slower and lower\n1605\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档的核心假设：s1 NVE 保持健康 (< 1.5×) 但 eval peak 显著低于 s0 (< 500\n1606\t    vs 821)。\n1607\t\n1608\t    当前 85K 数据（eval 152, ve_ratio 0.40）显示 s1 的学习速度远慢于 s0\n1609\t\n1610\t    （s0 在 85K 已达 364, s1 仅 152）。这种差异来自 seed-dependent 的学习动力学：\n1611\t\n1612\t    σ=0.2 噪声对 s1 的特定初始化更具破坏性，降低了有效 conditioning precision\n1613\t\n1614\t    到 s1 的学习过程无法充分利用时间信息的程度。\n1615\t\n1616\t    NVE 保持 < 1.0× 因为噪声确实阻止了 co-adaptation——\n1617\t\n1618\t    但代价是 s1 的学习效率显著降低。\n1619\t\n1620\t    这证实了 median 假设：noise 防住了 CIVO 但未能维持 baseline-competitive performance——\n1621\t\n1622\t    最优 σ 不仅是 environment-specific 还可能是 seed/initialization-specific。\n1623\t\n1624\t    '\n1625\t  tables:\n1626\t  - title: TCN σ=0.2 Walker per-seed comparison\n1627\t    columns:\n1628\t    - seed\n1629\t    - eval_peak\n1630\t    - nve_max\n1631\t    - prevention\n1632\t    - baseline_%\n1633\t    rows:\n1634\t    - - s0\n1635\t      - 821\n1636\t      - 0.908\n1637\t      - 'Yes'\n1638\t      - 90%\n1639\t    - - s1 (projected)\n1640\t      - 460\n1641\t      - 0.65\n1642\t      - 'Yes'\n1643\t      - 50%\n1644\t    - - mean\n1645\t      - 641\n1646\t      - 0.78\n1647\t      - 2/2\n1648\t      - 70%\n1649\t  figures_description:\n1650\t  - 'Fig: TCN σ=0.2 s0 vs s1 eval trajectory — s0 reaches 821 but s1 only ~460'\n1651\t  - 'Fig: per-seed NVE overlay — both below 1.0× but s1 starts higher (more vulnerable)'\n1652\t  analysis: 'TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker 上 2/2 prevention（NVE < 1.5×），但性能 variance 大：\n1653\t\n1654\t    s0 达 90% baseline 而 s1 仅 ~50%。Per-seed eval peak 在 [460, 821] 范围内，\n1655\t\n1656\t    mean ~641（70% baseline）。这比 untreated 008d 好得多（82-268, 9-29%），\n1657\t\n1658\t    但不够 robust 来作为 universal recommendation。\n1659\t\n1660\t    论文应报告 per-seed variation 并讨论 initialization sensitivity。\n1661\t\n1662\t    '\n1663\t- name: TCN Cheetah s0 σ=0.5 (running — median prediction)\n1664\t  plan_id: 'registry: exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05'\n1665\t  description: 'TCN on Cheetah with σ=0.5. Current: 16K steps, eval 78.3.'\n1666\t  expected_results:\n1667\t    eval_trajectory_projected:\n1668\t      15K: 78\n1669\t      25K: 160\n1670\t      35K: 220\n1671\t      45K: 180\n1672\t      55K: 130\n1673\t      65K: 80\n1674\t      75K: 50\n1675\t      85K: 30\n1676\t      95K: 15\n1677\t      105K: 10\n1678\t    eval_peak: 220\n1679\t    eval_peak_step: 35K\n1680\t    nve_55K: 4.5\n1681\t    nve_65K: 8.2\n1682\t    nve_105K: 15.0\n1683\t    nve_max: 15.0\n1684\t    civo_prevention: false\n1685\t    vs_untreated_cheetah_010b:\n1686\t      010b_nve_peak: 70.6\n1687\t      tcn_nve_peak: 15.0\n1688\t      reduction_factor: 4.7× (but still >> 1.5×)\n1689\t      eval_peak_comparison: 220 vs 248 (similar)\n1690\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 CIVO severity 是 Walker 的 10-50×（NVE 8-108× vs 2-6×）。\n1691\t\n1692\t    σ=0.5 的噪声幅度约为 dt_emb std 的 0.5×——在 Walker 上这已经过量（σ=0.5 Walker NVE peak 4.0），\n1693\t\n1694\t    在 Cheetah 上仍然不足。Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 产生的 CIVO 力度\n1695\t\n1696\t    远超 σ=0.5 噪声的 damping capacity。\n1697\t\n1698\t    结果是 NVE 仍然攀升到 15×（虽然低于 untreated 的 70.6×，reduction ~4.7×），\n1699\t\n1700\t    但 15× 远超 1.5× threshold → CIVO 仍然发生。\n1701\t\n1702\t    这验证了 median 假设：σ=0.5 不足以覆盖 Cheetah 的 severity gap，\n1703\t\n1704\t    需要更大的 σ（可能 σ=2.0-5.0）但过大的 σ 会完全破坏有用信号。\n1705\t\n1706\t    这就是 \"narrow band\" problem——optimal σ 可能对 Cheetah 不存在。\n1707\t\n1708\t    '\n1709\t  tables:\n1710\t  - title: TCN Cheetah σ sensitivity prediction\n1711\t    columns:\n1712\t    - σ\n1713\t    - nve_max\n1714\t    - eval_peak\n1715\t    - prevention\n1716\t    rows:\n1717\t    - - 0.2 (actual)\n1718\t      - 1.9\n1719\t      - 300\n1720\t      - No (σ insufficient)\n1721\t    - - 0.5 (projected)\n1722\t      - 15.0\n1723\t      - 220\n1724\t      - No (still insufficient)\n1725\t    - - 1.0 (hypothetical)\n1726\t      - 6.0\n1727\t      - 100\n1728\t      - No (destroys signal)\n1729\t    - - 2.0 (hypothetical)\n1730\t      - 2.5\n1731\t      - 50\n1732\t      - No (all signal lost)\n1733\t  figures_description:\n1734\t  - 'Fig: Cheetah TCN failure — NVE still explodes despite σ=0.5 noise'\n1735\t  - 'Fig: Cross-environment TCN comparison — Walker σ=0.2 succeeds vs Cheetah σ=0.5\n1736\t    fails'\n1737\t  analysis: 'Cheetah TCN 失败是 median 档的定义性结果。\n1738\t\n1739\t    Combined with Walker σ=0.2 success and σ=0.5 failure，结论是：\n1740\t\n1741\t    (1) Forward-pass noise 方向正确——TCN 确实 reduces CIVO severity (70.6→15×)\n1742\t\n1743\t    (2) 但 reduction 不足以跨 severity threshold\n1744\t\n1745\t    (3) Optimal σ 是 environment-specific 且可能不存在 universal value\n1746\t\n1747\t    论文 C8 claims 必须加 \"Walker Walk only\" scope 限定。\n1748\t\n1749\t    '\n1750\t- name: TCN Walker s0 σ=0.1 (running — median prediction)\n1751\t  plan_id: 'registry: exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01'\n1752\t  description: 'Lower noise test: σ=0.1 on Walker Walk. Currently early stage.'\n1753\t  expected_results:\n1754\t    eval_trajectory_projected:\n1755\t      25K: 200\n1756\t      35K: 280\n1757\t      45K: 350\n1758\t      55K: 300\n1759\t      65K: 250\n1760\t      75K: 200\n1761\t      85K: 280\n1762\t      95K: 320\n1763\t      105K: 380\n1764\t      115K: 450\n1765\t      135K: 500\n1766\t      155K: 530\n1767\t      175K: 580\n1768\t      195K: 560\n1769\t      215K: 550\n1770\t    eval_peak: 580\n1771\t    eval_peak_step: 175K\n1772\t    nve_max: 1.65\n1773\t    nve_max_step: 65K\n1774\t    nve_final: 0.25\n1775\t    civo_prevention: false\n1776\t    note: NVE briefly breaches 1.5× — σ=0.1 provides insufficient noise to prevent\n1777\t      transient CIVO\n1778\t  result_rationale: 'σ=0.1 噪声幅度仅为 dt_emb std 的 10%，不足以显著降低 conditioning precision。\n1779\t\n1780\t    RSSM 和 critic 仍然可以在噪声背景下提取足够精确的 dt 信号来建立 co-adaptation。\n1781\t\n1782\t    NVE 在 55-75K 区间可能短暂突破 1.5×（与 σ=0.2 的 0.908 peak 对比，\n1783\t\n1784\t    σ=0.1 的 damping capacity 约为 σ=0.2 的一半）。\n1785\t\n1786\t    但因为噪声不为零，CIVO 不会达到 untreated 的严重程度——\n1787\t\n1788\t    更像是 \"attenuated CIVO\" 而非 \"prevented CIVO\"。\n1789\t\n1790\t    最终可能 self-correct（类似 009b 的轨迹），eval 恢复到 ~550（60% baseline）。\n1791\t\n1792\t    σ=0.1 < σ=0.2 < σ=0.5 构成 dose-response：\n1793\t\n1794\t    太少 (0.1) → attenuated but not prevented；\n1795\t\n1796\t    适中 (0.2) → prevented in Walker；\n1797\t\n1798\t    太多 (0.5) → prevented but performance destroyed。\n1799\t\n1800\t    '\n1801\t  tables:\n1802\t  - title: Walker TCN dose-response (σ sweep)\n1803\t    columns:\n1804\t    - σ\n1805\t    - nve_max\n1806\t    - eval_peak\n1807\t    - prevention\n1808\t    - performance\n1809\t    rows:\n1810\t    - - 0 (untreated 008d)\n1811\t      - '4.12'\n1812\t      - '167'\n1813\t      - 'No'\n1814\t      - 18%\n1815\t    - - 0.1 (projected)\n1816\t      - '1.65'\n1817\t      - '580'\n1818\t      - No (borderline)\n1819\t      - 63%\n1820\t    - - 0.2 (s0 actual)\n1821\t      - '0.908'\n1822\t      - '821'\n1823\t      - 'Yes'\n1824\t      - 90%\n1825\t    - - 0.2 (s1 projected)\n1826\t      - '0.65'\n1827\t      - '460'\n1828\t      - 'Yes'\n1829\t      - 50%\n1830\t    - - 0.5 (s0 actual)\n1831\t      - '4.0'\n1832\t      - '366'\n1833\t      - No (oscillatory)\n1834\t      - 40%\n1835\t  figures_description:\n1836\t  - 'Fig: σ dose-response curve — there is a narrow effective band around σ=0.2 for\n1837\t    Walker'\n1838\t  analysis: 'σ=0.1 的 borderline 结果进一步确认 optimal σ 的 narrow band 特性。\n1839\t\n1840\t    Walker 的 effective σ range 大约是 [0.15, 0.35]，\n1841\t\n1842\t    这个 band 的位置和宽度是 environment-specific 的。\n1843\t\n1844\t    论文 Section 6 应讨论这一 calibration challenge 并推荐 adaptive σ scheduling。\n1845\t\n1846\t    '\n1847\t- name: TCN PickCube s0 σ=0.2 (running — median prediction)\n1848\t  plan_id: 'registry: exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02'\n1849\t  description: TCN on PickCube (manipulation task). Tests cross-task-type generalization.\n1850\t  expected_results:\n1851\t    eval_peak: 35\n1852\t    eval_final: 22\n1853\t    nve_peak: 2.8\n1854\t    nve_final: 0.08\n1855\t    civo_prevention: false\n1856\t    pattern: transient CIVO → value collapse (similar to exp_019b)\n1857\t    note: PickCube dynamics fundamentally different from locomotion — σ=0.2 not calibrated\n1858\t      for this task\n1859\t  result_rationale: 'PickCube 是 manipulation task（抓取并放置），dynamics 与 locomotion 完全不同——\n1860\t\n1861\t    contact dynamics 是 discontinuous（抓住/未抓住），reward 是 sparse（成功/失败）。\n1862\t\n1863\t    σ=0.2 的校准基于 Walker 的 RSSM fidelity gap profile，对 PickCube 未必适用。\n1864\t\n1865\t    PickCube 的 baseline 性能本就较低 (~58-69 eval)，CIVO 表现为\n1866\t\n1867\t    transient overestimation → value collapse（与 exp_019b 相似）。\n1868\t\n1869\t    TCN 不太可能在 PickCube 上成功，因为：\n1870\t\n1871\t    (1) σ=0.2 未针对 manipulation task 校准\n1872\t\n1873\t    (2) PickCube 的 CIVO 模式是 transient → value collapse，而非 sustained amplification\n1874\t\n1875\t    (3) Sparse reward 环境中 noise 对 learning signal 的破坏更严重\n1876\t\n1877\t    '\n1878\t  tables: []\n1879\t  figures_description:\n1880\t  - 'Fig: PickCube TCN — similar trajectory to untreated exp_019b, TCN ineffective'\n1881\t  analysis: 'PickCube TCN 失败（如果确认）进一步支持 median 档的 \"no universal σ\" 结论。\n1882\t\n1883\t    但 PickCube 结果应作为 supplementary material 而非 main text，\n1884\t\n1885\t    因为 PickCube 的 CIVO 模式本就与 locomotion 不同（transient vs sustained）。\n1886\t\n1887\t    论文应 scope C8 claims 为 \"locomotion tasks with sustained CIVO pattern\"。'\n1888\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc4e0f6b-485a-459f-a513-fa7886e114ae","uuid":"4f157ea5-ce06-4485-afb9-13f99d28cdee","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:56:20.883Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T155150/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Median 档核心叙事：C1-C7 诊断主线完全成立（31+ 配置、2+ 环境），C8 降级为 \"exploratory\n  forward-pass intervention\"。\n\n  TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker Walk 上是项目首个完全预防 CIVO 的干预（s0 NVE 全程 < 1.0×，eval peak 821），\n\n  但 s1 eval peak 显著低于 s0（< 500），Cheetah σ=0.5 失败（NVE 3-20×）。\n\n  最优 σ 是 environment-specific 且 narrow band（σ=0.1 不足、σ=0.5 过量、σ=0.2 仅 Walker 有效），\n\n  无 universal σ 存在。Forward-pass principle 方向正确但实现需要 adaptive calibration（超出本文 scope）。\n\n\n  叙事重心移回诊断：SGS 全面失败（C7, 1/17 across 3 variants）+ TCN Walker 成功 + TCN Cheetah 失败\n\n  共同构成 \"干预难度梯度\"——backward-pass (SGS) < forward-pass uniform noise (TCN) < (future)\n  adaptive forward-pass。\n\n  C8 标题从 \"forward-pass intervention\" 改为 \"exploratory forward-pass intervention\"，\n\n  所有 TCN 结论加 \"Walker Walk only\" scope 限定，Cheetah 失败作为 \"calibration challenge\" 呈现。\n\n\n  Running experiments 预测：\n\n  - exp_029a (TCN Walker s1 σ=0.2)：NVE 保持 < 1.5×，eval peak ~450（远低于 s0 的 821），prevention\n  成功但性能不可泛化\n\n  - exp_030b (TCN Cheetah s0 σ=0.5)：NVE 3-15×，eval peak ~120-200，Cheetah severity\n  gap 无法被 σ=0.5 覆盖\n\n  - exp_029c (TCN Walker s0 σ=0.1)：NVE 可能 breach 1.5×（噪声不足），eval peak ~300-500\n\n  - exp_031 (TCN PickCube s0 σ=0.2)：预计 negative——PickCube 动力学与 locomotion 差异大，σ=0.2\n  未必适用\n\n\n  Paper claims：C1-C7 fully supported (7 claims)，C8 partial (scoped to Walker proof-of-concept)。\n\n  CoRL reviewer 可能要求补充 environment 或 challenge robustness——准备 rebuttal 强调诊断贡献独立于 C8。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Replicate CIVO trigger with 2 additional independent seeds. 008d config:\n    dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8.'\n  expected_results:\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 31\n        15K: 155\n        25K: 170\n        35K: 150\n        45K: 143\n        55K: 85\n        65K: 245\n        75K: 180\n        85K: 200\n        95K: 135\n        105K: 130\n      eval_peak: 245\n      eval_peak_step: 65K\n      eval_final: 130\n      nve_25K: 1.78\n      nve_35K: 1.71\n      nve_45K: 2.09\n      nve_55K: 4.12\n      nve_peak: 4.12\n      nve_peak_step: 55K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_type: classic CIVO (value-driven, entropy decreasing)\n      collapse_onset: 25K\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 39\n        15K: 144\n        25K: 141\n        35K: 164\n        45K: 141\n        55K: 172\n        65K: 209\n        75K: 197\n        85K: 236\n        95K: 279\n        105K: 268\n      eval_peak: 279\n      eval_peak_step: 95K\n      eval_final: 268\n      nve_25K: 2.05\n      nve_35K: 1.24\n      nve_45K: 1.62\n      nve_55K: 1.41\n      nve_65K: 0.94\n      nve_75K: 0.66\n      nve_85K: 0.51\n      nve_95K: 0.43\n      nve_105K: 0.38\n      nve_peak: 2.05\n      nve_peak_step: 25K\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_type: transient CIVO, self-correction\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 2/2 seeds\n      collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n      nve_threshold_separating_power: maintained — both seeds exceed 1.5× at some\n        point\n  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 可靠地诱导 NVE > 1.5×（2/2 seeds），因为 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 fidelity\n    gap\n\n    通过精确的 dt_embedding conditioning 被放大为系统性 reward overestimation。\n\n    Collapse 是 stochastic 的（1/2），取决于训练早期的随机性（权重初始化、mini-batch 采样序列）\n\n    是否让 NVE 跨过 \"point of no return\" threshold 从而锁定正反馈循环。\n\n    Seed 2 在 45K 后 NVE 开始下降（1.62→0.38），展示了 value self-correction——\n\n    early stochasticity 使其避开了持续 overestimation 的轨迹。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008d cross-seed NVE comparison\n    columns:\n    - step\n    - seed1_nve\n    - seed2_nve\n    - pathological_threshold\n    rows:\n    - - 25K\n      - 1.78\n      - 2.05\n      - 1.5\n    - - 35K\n      - 1.71\n      - 1.24\n      - 1.5\n    - - 45K\n      - 2.09\n      - 1.62\n      - 1.5\n    - - 55K\n      - 4.12\n      - 1.41\n      - 1.5\n    - - 105K\n      - collapsed\n      - 0.38\n      - 1.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig A: 008d seed 1 vs seed 2 eval trajectory — seed 1 collapses at 55K while\n    seed 2 shows slow recovery to 268'\n  - 'Fig B: NVE trajectory overlay — both exceed 1.5× early, seed 1 accelerates (sustained),\n    seed 2 self-corrects (transient)'\n  analysis: 'C2 因果方向在两个独立 seed 上复现。NVE > 1.5× threshold 的 separating power\n\n    从 4/4 (原始) 维持。关键新增发现：value self-correction mechanism (seed 2)\n\n    的存在说明 CIVO 不是 deterministic collapse 而是 stochastic bifurcation——\n\n    early training dynamics 决定 sustained vs transient 轨迹。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no CIVO) with additional\n    seeds.\n  expected_results:\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 30\n        15K: 165\n        25K: 195\n        35K: 210\n        45K: 190\n        55K: 175\n        65K: 370\n        75K: 320\n        85K: 250\n        95K: 320\n        105K: 500\n      eval_peak: 500\n      eval_peak_step: 105K\n      eval_final: 500\n      nve_max_35kplus: 1.02\n      nve_105K: 0.3\n      collapse: false\n      reward_MAE: 0.75\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 30\n        15K: 157\n        25K: 169\n        35K: 179\n        45K: 211\n        55K: 239\n        65K: 244\n        75K: 359\n        85K: 227\n        95K: 191\n        105K: 148\n      eval_peak: 359\n      eval_peak_step: 75K\n      eval_final: 148\n      nve_max_35kplus: 1.26\n      nve_105K: 1.14\n      collapse: false\n      pattern: peak-then-decline, no CIVO but poor late performance\n    seed3:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 31\n        15K: 148\n        25K: 180\n        35K: 220\n        45K: 255\n        55K: 300\n        65K: 280\n        75K: 310\n        85K: 350\n        95K: 290\n        105K: 312\n      eval_peak: 350\n      eval_peak_step: 85K\n      eval_final: 312\n      nve_max_35kplus: 0.85\n      nve_105K: 0.52\n      collapse: false\n    seed4:\n      eval_peak: 488\n      eval_final: 307\n      nve_peak: 1.41\n      nve_105K: 0.58\n      collapse: false\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 0/4 seeds\n      collapse_rate: 0/4\n      eval_range_105K: '[148, 500]'\n      mean_nve_105K: 0.64\n  result_rationale: '去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01×\n    vs 008d 的 2.78×），\n\n    reward_MAE 升至 baseline 75×。CIVO 反馈循环被完全阻断——critic 无法利用精确的 dt 信号\n\n    进行 value exploitation。所有 seed 的 NVE 保持 < 1.5×（最高 1.26×，瞬态）。\n\n    但性能受限（eval 148-500 vs baseline 916）因为模型丧失了所有时间信息编码能力。\n\n    Seed 间高 variance（148-500）反映了无时间信息条件下的学习不稳定性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'No-dt-emb causal control: 4-seed summary'\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_peak\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_105K\n    - CIVO\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 500\n      - 500\n      - 1.02\n      - 0.3\n      - 'No'\n    - - 2\n      - 359\n      - 148\n      - 1.26\n      - 1.14\n      - 'No'\n    - - 3\n      - 350\n      - 312\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.52\n      - 'No'\n    - - 4\n      - 488\n      - 307\n      - 1.41\n      - 0.58\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 008f 4-seed NVE overlay — all seeds remain below 1.5× threshold (dashed\n    line), contrasting sharply with 008d''s 2/2 breaches'\n  analysis: '因果控制在 4 seeds 上 100% 复现（0/4 CIVO）。与 008d 的对比：trained dt_emb 2/2 exceed\n    1.5×，\n\n    no dt_emb 0/4 exceed 1.5× → 6/6 perfect classification on this pair。\n\n    008f 的角色是因果控制实验（非推荐方案），证明 dt_embedding conditioning 是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression with unexposed dt_emb (trained but\n    only on dt=1 data). Subsample OFF + H=15.\n  expected_results:\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 31\n        15K: 167\n        25K: 140\n        35K: 394\n        45K: 414\n        55K: 441\n        65K: 492\n        75K: 452\n        85K: 547\n        95K: 629\n        105K: 631\n      eval_peak: 631\n      eval_peak_step: 105K\n      eval_final: 631\n      nve_105K: 0.43\n      civo_alert: 0\n      pattern: slow but steady climb, no zigzag\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 31\n        15K: 175\n        25K: 280\n        35K: 410\n        45K: 380\n        55K: 608\n        65K: 654\n        75K: 534\n        85K: 605\n        95K: 819\n        105K: 899\n      eval_peak: 899\n      eval_peak_step: 105K\n      eval_final: 899\n      nve_105K: 0.33\n      civo_alert: 0\n      pattern: strong recovery, near-baseline performance\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 0/2\n      collapse_rate: 0/2\n      eval_range_105K: '[631, 899]'\n      mean_eval_105K: 765\n      vs_baseline_105K: -5% to -31%\n  result_rationale: 'Unexposed dt_emb（trained 但仅见过 dt=1 数据）保留了有用的时间表征但无法被 dt>1 exploitation。\n\n    因为 subsample OFF 意味着训练数据全部是 dt=1 transitions，dt_embedding 学到的是 dt=1 的表征——\n\n    当 imagination 用 dt=2 时，embedding 提供的是不精确的（dt=1-tuned）信号，\n\n    critic 无法建立精确 dt>1 conditioning → CIVO 反馈循环无法启动。\n\n    Value growth 被抑制在 baseline 水平以下（NVE 0.33-0.43×），性能保留 69-98% baseline。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Unexposed dt_emb: value suppression evidence'\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_105K\n    - vs_baseline\n    - pattern\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 778\n      - 0.59\n      - -15.1%\n      - zigzag two-cycle recovery\n    - - 1\n      - 631\n      - 0.43\n      - -31.1%\n      - slow steady climb\n    - - 2\n      - 899\n      - 0.33\n      - -1.8%\n      - strong recovery\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 3-seed 008a eval trajectory — all show recovery patterns (zigzag or steady),\n    none collapse'\n  - 'Fig: NVE overlay — all seeds maintain NVE < 1.0× at 105K, confirming structural\n    value suppression'\n  analysis: 'C3 在 3 seeds (含原始 s0) 上确认：unexposed dt_emb 可靠抑制 value overestimation\n    (0/3 CIVO)。\n\n    性能范围 631-899 (69-98% baseline) 远优于 008f (148-500, 16-55%)，\n\n    说明保留 dt_embedding 架构但不暴露于 dt>1 数据是更优的 value protection 策略。\n\n    Seed 间 variance (631 vs 899) 反映了正常的 RL 训练随机性，非系统性问题。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imag mitigation) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination with trained dt_emb. Tests\n    whether restricting imagination prevents collapse.\n  expected_results:\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 31\n        15K: 131\n        25K: 156\n        35K: 276\n        45K: 382\n        55K: 487\n        65K: 581\n        75K: 574\n        85K: 657\n        95K: 852\n        105K: 870\n      eval_peak: 870\n      eval_peak_step: 105K\n      nve_stable_range: 0.72-0.80×\n      nve_peak: 0.8\n      collapse: false\n      gate_dt_mean: 1.0\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 39\n        15K: 181\n        25K: 212\n        35K: 320\n        45K: 357\n        55K: 418\n        65K: 435\n        75K: 577\n        85K: 715\n        95K: 452\n        105K: 137\n      eval_peak: 715\n      eval_peak_step: 85K\n      eval_final: 137\n      nve_85K: 0.68\n      nve_95K: 1.34\n      nve_105K: 3.78\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 95K\n      collapse_type: non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy increasing)\n      actor_entropy_85K: -5.21\n      actor_entropy_105K: -3.83\n      gate_dt_mean: 1.0\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n      c6_status: PARTIALLY FALSIFIED\n  result_rationale: 'dt=1 imagination 消除了 CIVO Pathway A（value 驱动的 overestimation），seed\n    1 因此健康（NVE 0.80×）。\n\n    但 trained dt_emb 在 dt>1 训练数据上学到的表征会改变 RSSM 的 latent space 结构——\n\n    即使 imagination 限制为 dt=1，被 dt>1 训练数据 \"污染\" 的表征仍可能导致\n\n    Pathway B（eval 驱动的 policy instability）。Seed 2 的崩溃动力学与经典 CIVO 定性不同：\n\n    value 温和变化 (+13%→-12%) 而 eval 暴跌 (-81%)，actor entropy 上升（策略变随机）——\n\n    这是 policy destabilization 而非 critic exploitation。\n\n    Collapse rate 1/2 与 008d (1/2) 相同，说明 dt=1 imagination 未降低总崩溃概率，\n\n    只是将机制从 CIVO 切换为 non-CIVO policy instability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 dual-pathway collapse comparison\n    columns:\n    - feature\n    - 008d_s1_CIVO\n    - 008e_v3_s2_nonCIVO\n    rows:\n    - - value change\n      - +130% (60→138)\n      - +13% (339→384)\n    - - eval change\n      - -43% (146→83)\n      - -81% (715→137)\n    - - NVE driver\n      - value numerator explosion\n      - eval denominator collapse\n    - - actor_entropy\n      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n    - - mechanism\n      - critic overestimate → actor exploit\n      - eval crash → value lags\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 008e_v3 seed 1 (healthy) vs seed 2 (collapsed) eval trajectories with baseline\n    overlay'\n  - 'Fig: actor_entropy comparison — CIVO pathway (008d) shows entropy decrease vs\n    non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2) shows entropy increase'\n  analysis: 'C6 partially falsified: dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)。\n\n    但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 不同 → trained dt_embedding 通过多条路径创造脆弱性。\n\n    009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。\n\n    论文表述：dt=1 imagination eliminates CIVO (Pathway A) but not all failure modes。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: Freeze dt_embedding (requires_grad=False), random init. Diagnoses whether\n    dt_emb TRAINING is the necessary condition for CIVO.\n  expected_results:\n    eval_trajectory:\n      5K: 31\n      15K: 168\n      25K: 172\n      35K: 202\n      45K: 122\n      55K: 106\n      65K: 160\n      75K: 80\n      85K: 184\n      95K: 238\n      105K: 204\n    eval_peak: 238\n    eval_peak_step: 95K\n    eval_final: 204\n    nve_85K: 0.47\n    nve_95K: 0.39\n    nve_105K: 0.42\n    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n    value_mean_105K: 56.2\n    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    collapse: false\n    collapse_mechanism: gradient starvation from frozen dt_emb\n  result_rationale: '冻结 dt_emb 阻止了训练驱动的 co-adaptation → NVE 保持健康 (0.39-0.47×)，远低于\n    1.5× 阈值。\n\n    但冻结的随机 embedding 向 RSSM 注入持续的无信息噪声信号，模型必须学会忽略它。\n\n    这导致 actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）：value landscape 在 embedding-conditioned states 周围变得平坦，\n\n    actor 无法获得有效的梯度信号来改进策略。性能严重受限（204 vs baseline 916, 22%）。\n\n    关键诊断结论：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——冻结 (015b) 和移除 (008f) 都阻止了 CIVO，\n\n    但各自引入不同的性能损伤机制（梯度饥饿 vs reward 预测失败）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 2×2 dt_emb intervention matrix\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - dt_emb_status\n    - CIVO\n    - eval_105K\n    - mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - 008d\n      - trained + active\n      - Yes (2/2)\n      - 82-268\n      - CIVO feedback loop\n    - - 008a\n      - trained + unexposed\n      - No (0/3)\n      - 631-899\n      - value suppression\n    - - 015b\n      - frozen (random)\n      - No (0/1)\n      - '204'\n      - gradient starvation\n    - - 008f\n      - removed (dim=0)\n      - No (0/4)\n      - 148-500\n      - reward prediction failure\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-config comparison showing eval trajectories and NVE — only trained+active\n    shows CIVO'\n  analysis: '015b 与 008d、008a、008f 构成完整的 2×2 消融矩阵。\n\n    只有 \"trained + active\" 配置触发 CIVO，确认 dt_emb 的训练过程（而非其存在本身）是 necessary condition。\n\n    这支持 C2 的 mechanistic claim：训练过程使 dt_emb 学到精确但错误的 dt>1 conditioning，\n\n    而非 dt_emb 的架构存在本身导致问题。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Narrow 008e_v3 collapse probability estimate from 1/2 to x/4.\n  expected_results:\n    seed3:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 35\n        15K: 145\n        25K: 195\n        35K: 310\n        45K: 380\n        55K: 440\n        65K: 460\n        75K: 510\n        85K: 520\n        95K: 320\n        105K: 93\n      eval_peak: 520\n      eval_peak_step: 85K\n      eval_final: 93\n      nve_peak: 4.02\n      nve_peak_step: 105K\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 85-95K\n      collapse_type: hybrid — eval-driven with moderate value acceleration\n    seed4:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 38\n        15K: 160\n        25K: 200\n        35K: 330\n        45K: 420\n        55K: 510\n        65K: 600\n        75K: 640\n        85K: 720\n        95K: 830\n        105K: 899\n      eval_peak: 899\n      eval_peak_step: 105K\n      eval_final: 899\n      nve_peak: 0.99\n      collapse: false\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      total_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n      collapsed_seeds:\n      - 2\n      - 3\n      healthy_seeds:\n      - 1\n      - 4\n      collapse_probability_estimate: 50% ± 25% (binomial CI)\n  result_rationale: '4 seeds 中 2 个崩溃（50%），与 008d 的 50% 崩溃率一致。\n\n    dt=1 imagination 确实消除了 CIVO Pathway A，但 Pathway B（eval-driven policy instability）\n\n    的基准崩溃概率仍然是 ~50%，与 dt=2 imagination 下的 CIVO 崩溃概率没有显著差异。\n\n    这说明 trained dt_emb 的脆弱性不仅在于 imagination 中的 dt>1 使用，\n\n    而在于训练数据中 dt>1 transitions 对 latent representation 的全局影响。\n\n    Healthy seeds (1, 4) 达到 870-899 (95-98% baseline)，说明当 Pathway B 不触发时，\n\n    dt=1 imagination 配置的性能上限接近 baseline。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_peak\n    - collapsed\n    - pathway\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 870\n      - 0.8\n      - 'No'\n      - —\n    - - 2\n      - 137\n      - 3.78\n      - 'Yes'\n      - B (eval-driven)\n    - - 3\n      - 93\n      - 4.02\n      - 'Yes'\n      - B (hybrid)\n    - - 4\n      - 899\n      - 0.99\n      - 'No'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-seed 008e_v3 eval trajectory overlay — bimodal outcome (850-900 vs <140)'\n  - 'Fig: collapse probability comparison: 008d (1/2 CIVO) vs 008e_v3 (2/4 non-CIVO)\n    — rates indistinguishable'\n  analysis: '2/4 崩溃率的 binomial 95% CI = [12%, 88%]，与 008d 的 50% 无法区分。\n\n    但两种配置的崩溃机制定性不同（CIVO vs non-CIVO）。\n\n    论文结论：trained dt_embedding 创造 ~50% 崩溃概率，与 imagination dt 设定无关。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment for v/e calibration and cross-environment\n    generalization.\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_peak: 625\n      eval_final_200K: 625\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n    seed1:\n      eval_peak: 573\n      eval_final_200K: 520\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.50-0.70\n    seed2:\n      eval_peak: 645\n      eval_final_200K: 645\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      mean_eval_final: 597\n      std_eval_final: 55\n      ve_ratio_converged: 0.50-0.70\n      all_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run baseline 在 DreamerV3 中稳定收敛到 ~520-650 range（低于 Walker\n    的 ~950），\n\n    因为 Cheetah 的 locomotion dynamics 更复杂——需要协调更多关节来维持前进速度，\n\n    且 reward 是 velocity-based 而非 position-based。\n\n    v/e ratio 收敛到 0.50-0.70，与 Walker baseline (0.69-0.72) 类似但略低，\n\n    反映了 Cheetah 的 higher return variance 降低了 value prediction 的 calibration 精度。\n\n    所有 3 seeds 稳定，无 CIVO（dt=1 configuration）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cheetah 3-seed baseline overlay — all converge to 520-650 range'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline 为后续 CIVO 实验提供 NVE normalization 参考。\n\n    Mean ~597 比 Walker ~930 低 36%——Cheetah 是更 challenging 的环境，\n\n    这会放大 CIVO severity（因为 RSSM prediction 在更复杂动力学下的 fidelity gap 更大）。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Replicate CIVO trigger in Cheetah Run. Expect severe CIVO due to wider\n    RSSM fidelity gap.\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 8\n        15K: 80\n        25K: 180\n        35K: 248\n        45K: 200\n        55K: 120\n        65K: 45\n        75K: 20\n        85K: 5\n        95K: 1\n        105K: 1\n      eval_peak: 248\n      eval_peak_step: 35K\n      nve_65K: 8.3\n      nve_105K: 70.6\n      collapse: true\n      civo_onset: 45K\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 10\n        15K: 95\n        25K: 220\n        35K: 310\n        45K: 280\n        55K: 170\n        65K: 80\n        75K: 30\n        85K: 15\n        95K: 52\n        105K: 52\n      eval_peak: 310\n      eval_peak_step: 35K\n      nve_55K: 5.8\n      nve_105K: 12.4\n      collapse: true\n      civo_onset: 45K\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        5K: 9\n        15K: 70\n        25K: 150\n        35K: 230\n        45K: 150\n        55K: 60\n        65K: 25\n        75K: 10\n        85K: 3\n        95K: 1\n        105K: 1\n      eval_peak: 230\n      eval_peak_step: 35K\n      nve_65K: 15.2\n      nve_105K: 108\n      collapse: true\n      civo_onset: 55K\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      collapse_rate: 3/3\n      nve_range: '[5.8, 108]'\n      eval_peak_range: '[230, 310]'\n      severity_vs_walker: ~10-50× more severe NVE\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 比 Walker 大得多——Cheetah 的 dynamics\n    更非线性\n\n    （多关节协调 + velocity reward），dt>1 prediction error 更大。\n\n    Trained dt_emb 提供精确但严重错误的 dt>1 conditioning →\n\n    value overestimation 幅度是 Walker 的 10-50×（Walker NVE 2-6× vs Cheetah 8-108×）。\n\n    所有 3 seeds 崩溃，因为 Cheetah 的 severity 足够高，使得 self-correction 的概率极低——\n\n    即使早期 stochasticity 有利，强大的正反馈循环也会在 45-55K 内压倒 self-correction 机制。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: CIVO severity cross-environment comparison\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - nve_range\n    - collapse_rate\n    - onset_step\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 2.0-4.1×\n      - 1/2 (50%)\n      - 25-35K\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - 5.8-108×\n      - 3/3 (100%)\n      - 45-55K\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cheetah 3-seed CIVO cascade — all collapse within 35-55K, NVE explodes to\n    10-100× range'\n  - 'Fig: Cross-environment NVE severity comparison (log scale) — Cheetah 1-2 orders\n    of magnitude worse'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah 的 100% collapse rate (3/3) vs Walker 的 50% (1/2) 确认 CIVO severity\n\n    是 environment-dependent 的。RSSM fidelity gap 在复杂动力学环境中被放大，\n\n    导致 CIVO 正反馈循环更强、self-correction 概率更低。\n\n    这为 C8 的 TCN calibration challenge 提供机制解释——\n\n    σ=0.2 足以 dampen Walker 的 2-6× NVE 但不足以对抗 Cheetah 的 8-108×。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: 'Causal control: no dt_embedding in Cheetah. Expect no CIVO but severe\n    reward prediction degradation.'\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_final: 97\n      nve_peak: 0.2\n      collapse: false\n      reward_MAE: '>0.8'\n    seed1:\n      eval_final: 77\n      eval_peak: 130\n      nve_peak: 0.1\n      collapse: false\n    seed2:\n      eval_final: 85\n      eval_peak: 110\n      nve_peak: 0.18\n      collapse: false\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      mean_eval_final: 86\n      vs_baseline: 14.4% of baseline (86/597)\n      nve_max: 0.2\n  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008f 相同的机制：移除 dt_embedding 完全阻断 CIVO 反馈循环（0/3 CIVO），\n\n    但 reward head 丧失时间分辨能力（reward_MAE > baseline 50×）。\n\n    Cheetah 的 velocity-based reward 对时间信息更敏感——\n\n    没有 dt 信息时 reward head 无法区分 \"前进一步\" 和 \"前进两步\" 的奖励差异，\n\n    导致 eval 仅达 baseline 的 14%（Walker 008f 达 16-55%）。\n\n    NVE 极低 (0.10-0.20×) 因为 critic 严重低估 value（缺乏 reward 信号）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cheetah no-dt-emb 3-seed eval — flat at 77-97, far below baseline 597 but\n    no collapse'\n  analysis: 'Embedding removal 在 Cheetah 上同样 100% 阻止 CIVO (0/3)，与 Walker (0/4) 一致。\n\n    跨两个环境 0/7 CIVO → removal 是 sufficient condition for CIVO prevention。\n\n    性能损伤在 Cheetah 更严重（14% vs Walker 16-55%），\n\n    因为 Cheetah 的 reward structure 对 temporal resolution 的依赖更强。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Value growth suppression in Cheetah. Unexposed dt_emb should maintain\n    near-baseline performance.\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_final_105K: 532\n      nve_105K: 0.49\n      collapse: false\n    seed1:\n      eval_final_105K: 504\n      nve_105K: 0.48\n      collapse: false\n    seed2:\n      eval_final_105K: 520\n      nve_105K: 0.45\n      collapse: false\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      mean_eval: 519\n      vs_baseline: 86.9% of baseline (519/597)\n      nve_range: 0.45-0.49\n  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008a 相同的机制：unexposed dt_emb 保留了有用的 dt=1 表征能力，\n\n    同时因为未暴露于 dt>1 数据而无法被 exploitation。\n\n    Cheetah 的性能保留率 (87%) 与 Walker (69-98%) 一致。\n\n    NVE 一致低于 0.5×，确认 value suppression 机制跨环境有效。\n\n    这是 Cheetah 上性能最好的非 baseline 配置（519 vs 008f 的 86 vs 008d 的 <52）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah configuration comparison\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - mean_eval\n    - vs_baseline\n    - CIVO_rate\n    - mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - baseline\n      - '597'\n      - 100%\n      - 0/3\n      - —\n    - - 008a (unexposed)\n      - '519'\n      - 87%\n      - 0/3\n      - value suppression\n    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - '86'\n      - 14%\n      - 0/3\n      - reward prediction failure\n    - - 008d (trained)\n      - <52\n      - <9%\n      - 3/3\n      - CIVO collapse\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cheetah 4-config eval comparison — unexposed dt_emb is the only viable non-baseline\n    configuration'\n  analysis: 'Unexposed dt_emb 在 Cheetah 上同样是最优的 CIVO-free 配置，\n\n    性能保留 87% baseline（vs 008f 的 14%）。\n\n    跨 Walker + Cheetah，unexposed dt_emb 一致提供 strong value protection\n\n    + high performance retention → 推荐 practical guideline。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Quantify RSSM fidelity gap across dt values from existing trained models.\n  expected_results:\n    baseline:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n      obs_gap_ratio: 2.04\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n      reward_gap_ratio: 1.56\n    008d_trained:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      obs_gap_ratio: 1.3\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n      reward_gap_ratio: 2.78\n    008f_no_dtEmb:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      obs_gap_ratio: 2.75\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n      reward_gap_ratio: 1.01\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM 的 autoregressive prediction error 随 temporal distance 增大（dt=2\n    obs_MSE 是 dt=1 的 2-2.75×）。\n\n    Trained dt_emb (008d) 的 obs gap 看似小 (1.30×) 但具有误导性——\n\n    其 dt=1 绝对误差本身已是 baseline 的 3× (41.31 vs 13.49)，说明模型整体已崩塌。\n\n    008d 的 reward gap (2.78×) 最大，因为 trained dt_emb 使 reward head 高度依赖精确的 dt 信息，\n\n    当 dt>1 prediction 不准确时 reward 误差被放大。\n\n    008f 的 reward gap (1.01×) 证明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法区分 dt 值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: RSSM Fidelity Table (absolute + ratio)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - dt1_obs_MSE\n    - dt2_obs_MSE\n    - obs_gap\n    - dt1_reward_MAE\n    - dt2_reward_MAE\n    - reward_gap\n    rows:\n    - - baseline\n      - 13.49\n      - 27.5\n      - 2.04×\n      - 0.0102\n      - 0.0159\n      - 1.56×\n    - - 008d (trained)\n      - 41.31\n      - 53.67\n      - 1.30×\n      - 0.0568\n      - 0.1579\n      - 2.78×\n    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - 8.01\n      - 22.04\n      - 2.75×\n      - 0.7469\n      - 0.7526\n      - 1.01×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: RSSM fidelity bar chart — absolute values side-by-side with ratio indicators,\n    avoiding ratio-only misleading interpretation'\n  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的 mechanistic foundation。\n\n    论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×) 误导审稿人。\n\n    关键洞察：trained dt_emb 通过精确 conditioning 让 reward head \"看到\" fidelity gap（reward_gap\n    2.78×），\n\n    而 008f 去掉 dt_emb 后 reward head 对 fidelity gap \"视而不见\"（reward_gap 1.01×）。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: Plot actor_entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configurations\n    to identify collapse signatures.\n  expected_results:\n    healthy_configs:\n      008a_s0:\n        entropy_55K: -3.8\n        entropy_105K: -4.9\n        trend: gradual stable decline\n      008e_v3_s1:\n        entropy_55K: -4.2\n        entropy_105K: -5.1\n        trend: gradual stable decline\n    civo_collapse:\n      008d_s1:\n        entropy_35K: -3.47\n        entropy_55K: -4.88\n        trend: accelerating decrease — policy locks into overestimated actions\n    nonCIVO_collapse:\n      008e_v3_s2:\n        entropy_85K: -5.21\n        entropy_105K: -3.83\n        trend: reversal — policy destabilizes, entropy increases\n    two_signatures_identified: true\n  result_rationale: '两种崩溃路径产生截然不同的 entropy signature：\n\n    CIVO (Pathway A): critic 高估 value → actor 过度 exploit → policy 变得确定性 → entropy\n    下降。\n\n    Non-CIVO (Pathway B): eval 崩塌 → value 滞后 → policy 失去方向 → entropy 上升（策略变随机）。\n\n    Healthy configs 展示自然的 entropy 下降（策略逐渐确定化），既不锁定也不崩溃。\n\n    这种 dual-signature 是 C6 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 的核心诊断证据。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-panel actor_entropy comparison — healthy (gradual decline), CIVO (rapid\n    decline → lock-in), non-CIVO (decline then reversal)'\n  analysis: 'Entropy analysis 提供了区分两种崩溃路径的简单诊断工具：\n\n    entropy 下降 + NVE 上升 = CIVO；entropy 上升 + eval 崩塌 = policy instability。\n\n    论文 Section 5 Discussion 应用此工具详细阐述 dual-pathway 发现。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return for trained vs untrained\n    dt_emb.\n  expected_results:\n    008d_trained:\n      value_distribution_shape: right-skewed, heavy tail above MC returns\n      mean_overestimation: +45% above MC return at 35K\n      overestimation_growing: true\n    008a_untrained:\n      value_distribution_shape: symmetric, centered on MC returns\n      mean_bias: < 5% of MC return\n      calibrated: true\n    baseline:\n      value_distribution_shape: slight right skew (normal MBRL overshoot)\n      mean_bias: ~10-15% above MC return (healthy)\n  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 的 value distribution 系统性偏右（overestimation）因为\n\n    critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 看到被放大的 reward predictions，\n\n    学到的 value function 反映了这些虚高的 imagined returns。\n\n    Untrained dt_emb 的 value 保持 calibrated 因为不精确的 dt conditioning\n\n    不会创建系统性偏差——各 imagination step 的误差是随机的，不累积。\n\n    Distribution 分析比单一 v/e ratio 更 informative，直接回应 R3 审稿关切。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: V(s) vs MC return scatter plots — 008d shows systematic overestimation growing\n    with training, 008a stays calibrated'\n  - 'Fig: Histogram of (V(s) - MC return) / MC return — 008d right-skewed, 008a centered\n    near zero'\n  analysis: '如果时间允许，此分析显著加强 C2 evidence。\n\n    直接回应 R3 (\"v/e ratio is crude proxy\") — distribution 分析提供\n\n    fine-grained overestimation 证据，而非单一 aggregate ratio。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: Track cosine similarity between dt=1 and dt=2 embedding vectors during\n    training.\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_similarity_trajectory:\n      init: 0.35\n      10K: 0.28\n      25K: 0.18\n      35K: 0.12\n      55K: 0.08\n      105K: 0.05\n    divergence_onset: ~10-25K (rapid separation phase)\n    divergence_correlates_with_civo: true\n  result_rationale: 'Training 驱动 dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 向不同方向特化——\n\n    dt=1 embedding 学到的表征对应 accurate single-step predictions，\n\n    dt=2 embedding 学到的对应 inaccurate multi-step predictions。\n\n    Cosine similarity 的快速下降（10-25K）与 CIVO onset (25-35K) 在时间上接近，\n\n    说明 embedding specialization 是 CIVO 的前置条件：\n\n    只有当 embeddings 足够分离，critic 才能利用精确的 dt conditioning 进行 exploitation。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cosine similarity(dt=1, dt=2) over training steps — rapid divergence at\n    10-25K precedes CIVO onset at 25-35K'\n  analysis: '这是一个 zero-cost 分析（从已保存的 checkpoints 计算），提供 mechanistic insight。\n\n    Embedding 分离是 CIVO 的 leading indicator——\n\n    可用于未来的 early detection / adaptive intervention trigger。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Compute AUROC and classification accuracy across multiple NVE thresholds\n    using all available seeds.\n  expected_results:\n    thresholds:\n      1.3x:\n        accuracy: 0.81\n        false_positive_rate: 0.15\n        note: too many false positives from transient fluctuations\n      1.5x:\n        accuracy: 0.94\n        false_positive_rate: 0.03\n        AUROC: 0.969\n        note: near-optimal — captures mechanistic threshold\n      1.7x:\n        accuracy: 0.9\n        false_positive_rate: 0.0\n        note: misses some self-correcting CIVO cases (e.g., 009b peak 1.62×)\n      2.0x:\n        accuracy: 0.84\n        false_positive_rate: 0.0\n        note: misses borderline cases\n    overall_AUROC: 0.969\n    recommended_threshold: 1.5\n    sample_size: 15/16 correct at 1.5× across 2 environments\n  result_rationale: '1.5× 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的 mechanistic inflection point：\n\n    当 NVE 超过 1.5× 时，value overestimation 驱动 actor 向 overestimated states 移动\n\n    的力度超过了 self-correction 机制（value loss gradient pushing value down）的力度。\n\n    低于 1.5× 的瞬态突破（如 baseline 的 transient fluctuation）通常自行消解。\n\n    1.3× threshold 引入过多 false positives 因为正常训练 variance 可达 1.2-1.3×。\n\n    2.0× threshold 遗漏了 self-correcting CIVO 案例（NVE 1.6-1.9× 的 transient breaches）。\n\n    AUROC 0.969 跨 2 环境表明 NVE 1.5× 是 robust 的跨环境诊断指标。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: NVE threshold classification performance\n    columns:\n    - threshold\n    - accuracy\n    - sensitivity\n    - specificity\n    - F1\n    rows:\n    - - 1.3×\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.8\n    - - 1.5×\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.94\n    - - 1.7×\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.82\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.9\n    - - 2.0×\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.71\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.83\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ROC curve for NVE threshold CIVO classification — AUROC = 0.969'\n  analysis: 'NVE 1.5× threshold 是论文最强的 quantitative result 之一（C2 的核心 diagnostic marker）。\n\n    AUROC 0.969 across 2 environments 提供强力证据支持 trained dt_emb → CIVO 的因果链。\n\n    建议将此分析放在 Section 4 的显著位置，配合 ROC curve 图。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment, broadening scope beyond\n    locomotion tasks.\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_peak: 820\n      eval_converged_200K: 790\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.60-0.72\n    seed1:\n      eval_peak: 780\n      eval_converged_200K: 760\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.58-0.70\n    seed2:\n      eval_peak: 845\n      eval_converged_200K: 810\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.62-0.74\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      mean_eval_converged: 787\n      std: 21\n      all_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 在 DreamerV3 中通常收敛到 ~750-850 range。\n\n    虽然 observation space 较小（5 dim vs Walker 24 dim），reward structure\n\n    （swing up + balance）需要精确的 timing control，但 dynamics 比 locomotion 简单。\n\n    Baseline 应稳定收敛，v/e ratio 在 0.58-0.74 range（与 Walker/Cheetah 一致）。\n\n    作为 non-locomotion 环境，Cartpole 拓宽了论文的 scope beyond locomotion tasks。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cartpole 3-seed baseline — stable convergence to ~780-810'\n  analysis: 'Cartpole baseline 提供第三个环境的 NVE normalization reference。\n\n    如果 v/e stable range 与 Walker/Cheetah 一致（~0.6-0.72），\n\n    说明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration pattern 跨环境稳定，\n\n    进一步支持 NVE 1.5× 作为 universal diagnostic threshold。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: Test CIVO trigger in Cartpole. Simpler dynamics → potentially less\n    severe CIVO.\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_peak: 520\n      eval_final_105K: 180\n      nve_peak: 3.8\n      collapse: true\n      civo_onset: 45K\n    seed1:\n      eval_peak: 580\n      eval_final_105K: 550\n      nve_peak: 1.85\n      collapse: false\n      note: transient NVE breach, self-correction\n    seed2:\n      eval_peak: 490\n      eval_final_105K: 120\n      nve_peak: 5.2\n      collapse: true\n      civo_onset: 55K\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3/3\n      collapse_rate: 2/3\n      mean_nve_peak: 3.6\n      severity: moderate — between Walker (2-4×) and Cheetah (8-108×)\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 dynamics 比 Walker 简单（更低维、更少关节），\n\n    RSSM 的 dt>1 fidelity gap 应该更小 → CIVO severity 中等 (NVE peak 2-6×)，\n\n    介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-108×) 之间。\n\n    但 mechanism 相同：trained dt_emb → RSSM fidelity gap amplification →\n\n    value overestimation → CIVO。NVE > 1.5× 应在所有 3 seeds 触发（3/3），\n\n    collapse 概率 ~50-67%（simpler dynamics 提供略强的 self-correction capacity）。\n\n    这验证 CIVO 不限于 locomotion tasks——mechanism 是 architecture-specific 而非 task-specific。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-environment CIVO severity comparison\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - complexity\n    - nve_peak_range\n    - collapse_rate\n    rows:\n    - - Cartpole Swingup\n      - low\n      - 1.8-5.2×\n      - 2/3\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - medium\n      - 2.0-4.1×\n      - 1/2\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - high\n      - 5.8-108×\n      - 3/3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 3-environment CIVO severity comparison — NVE severity scales with environment\n    complexity'\n  analysis: 'Cartpole CIVO 验证了 C2 在 non-locomotion 环境的 generality。\n\n    三个环境的 severity ordering (Cartpole < Walker < Cheetah) 与 RSSM fidelity gap\n\n    的环境依赖性一致，为 C4 (longer dt amplifies) 提供跨环境证据。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: 'Causal control in Cartpole: no dt_embedding → no CIVO.'\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_final: 540\n      nve_peak: 0.35\n      collapse: false\n    seed1:\n      eval_final: 510\n      nve_peak: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n    seed2:\n      eval_final: 560\n      nve_peak: 0.3\n      collapse: false\n    cross_seed_summary:\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      mean_eval_final: 537\n      vs_baseline: 68% of baseline (537/787)\n      nve_max: 0.42\n  result_rationale: '移除 dt_embedding 在 Cartpole 上同样完全阻断 CIVO (0/3)。\n\n    性能保留率 (68%) 高于 Cheetah (14%) 但低于 Walker (16-55%)——\n\n    Cartpole 的 reward 对 temporal resolution 的依赖介于两者之间。\n\n    NVE 一致低于 0.5×，与 Walker 和 Cheetah 的 no-dt-emb 配置模式一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Embedding removal causal control: 3-environment summary'\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - CIVO_rate\n    - eval_vs_baseline\n    - nve_max\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 0/4\n      - 16-55%\n      - 1.41×\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - 0/3\n      - 14%\n      - 0.20×\n    - - Cartpole Swingup\n      - 0/3\n      - 68%\n      - 0.42×\n    - - Total\n      - 0/10\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 3-environment embedding removal — 0/10 CIVO across all environments'\n  analysis: '跨 3 环境 0/10 CIVO → embedding removal 作为 causal control 的 statistical\n    power 极强。\n\n    与 trained dt_emb 的 8/8 NVE > 1.5× 构成 near-perfect classification。\n\n    这是 C2 因果论证的 strongest evidence，显著加强了论文的 methodological rigor。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: Third DMC environment for stronger generalization claim. Hopper Hop\n    requires explosive leg control.\n  expected_results:\n    baseline:\n      seed_eval_range:\n      - 180\n      - 280\n      mean_eval_converged: 230\n      ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.70\n      note: Hopper Hop is challenging — DreamerV3 typically reaches 200-300\n    trained_dt_emb:\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3/3\n      collapse_rate: 2/3\n      nve_peak_range:\n      - 4.0\n      - 40.0\n      eval_peak_range:\n      - 80\n      - 180\n      severity: moderate-high — Hopper dynamics nonlinear\n    no_dt_emb:\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      eval_range:\n      - 50\n      - 100\n      nve_max: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 的动力学高度非线性——单腿跳跃需要精确的 torque timing，\n\n    微小误差导致 fall over。DreamerV3 baseline 通常在 200-300 range（较低）。\n\n    RSSM 在 Hopper 的 fidelity gap 应该 moderate-high\n\n    （比 Walker 复杂因为 contact dynamics 更 discontinuous，但比 Cheetah 简单因为 fewer joints）。\n\n    Trained dt_emb → CIVO 应触发 (3/3 NVE > 1.5×)，severity 4-40× range。\n\n    No dt_emb control → 0/3 CIVO，完成 3-environment causal control matrix。\n\n    作为 P2 优先级，Hopper 主要提供 \"breadth\" 而非新的 mechanistic insight。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Hopper Hop 3-config summary\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - eval_range\n    - CIVO_rate\n    - nve_range\n    rows:\n    - - baseline\n      - 180-280\n      - 0/3\n      - —\n    - - trained dt_emb\n      - 80-180 peak, collapse\n      - 2/3\n      - 4-40×\n    - - no dt_emb\n      - 50-100\n      - 0/3\n      - <0.5×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Hopper Hop completes the 4-environment CIVO trigger map'\n  analysis: 'Hopper 作为第四个环境将 C1-C2 的 generalization 从 \"2 locomotion + 1 non-locomotion\"\n\n    扩展到 \"3 locomotion + 1 non-locomotion\"。如果 P2 预算允许，\n\n    inclusion 显著加强 against R1 (\"limited to one environment\")。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty during imagination; truncate when\n    exceeding threshold.\n  expected_results:\n    eval_peak: 320\n    eval_final_105K: 280\n    nve_peak: 2.1\n    nve_onset_step: 55K\n    collapse: true\n    collapse_onset: 85K\n    truncation_behavior:\n      mean_truncation_step: step 4-5 of 15-step rollout (at dt=2)\n      truncation_frequency_at_55K: 60% of imagination rollouts truncated\n      truncation_frequency_at_85K: 90% of imagination rollouts truncated\n    improvement_vs_008d:\n      008d_eval_peak: 167\n      pilot_eval_peak: 320\n      onset_delay: +30K steps\n      ultimate_outcome: still collapses\n  result_rationale: \"RSSM uncertainty estimation 在训练早期是有用的（truncation 确实截断了高误差的 imagination\\\n    \\ steps），\\n但存在两个根本局限：\\n(1) RSSM 的 uncertainty 本身在 CIVO regime 下变得不准确——\\n    当\\\n    \\ representation 被 dt_emb co-adaptation 扭曲时，model 对自身误差的估计也失效。\\n(2) Aggressive\\\n    \\ truncation 大幅缩短了 effective imagination horizon，\\n    相当于将 H=15 降到 H=4-5，严重损伤了\\\n    \\ actor-critic 的 learning signal quality。\\n结果是 CIVO onset 延迟 ~30K steps（320 vs\\\n    \\ 008d 的 167 peak），\\n但最终仍崩溃，因为 uncertainty estimation 的 corruption 使 truncation\\\n    \\ 失效。\\n作为 P1 pilot，结论是 uncertainty truncation alone 不足——\\n需要与 forward-pass intervention\\\n    \\ (如 TCN) 结合使用。\\n\"\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Truncation pilot eval + NVE overlay with 008d comparison — delayed onset\n    but eventual collapse'\n  - 'Fig: Truncation frequency over training — increases from 20% to 90%, indicating\n    model deterioration'\n  analysis: 'Uncertainty truncation 的失败模式与 SGS 类似——\n\n    它试图在 output/behavior 层面修复 representation-level 的问题。\n\n    CIVO 的 root cause 在于 trained dt_emb 对 latent representation 的影响，\n\n    不是 imagination rollout 的长度。这进一步支持 C7/C8 的论证：\n\n    只有 forward-pass level intervention 才能直接作用于 root cause。\n\n    '\n- name: TCN Walker s1 σ=0.2 (running — median prediction)\n  plan_id: 'registry: exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02'\n  description: 'Second seed for TCN σ=0.2 on Walker. Current status: 85K steps, eval\n    152, ve_ratio 0.40.'\n  expected_results:\n    eval_trajectory_projected:\n      85K: 152\n      95K: 180\n      105K: 210\n      115K: 280\n      125K: 310\n      135K: 340\n      145K: 380\n      155K: 410\n      165K: 430\n      175K: 460\n      185K: 440\n      195K: 420\n      205K: 430\n      215K: 445\n    eval_peak: 460\n    eval_peak_step: 175K\n    eval_last10_mean: 430\n    nve_trajectory_projected:\n      85K: 0.4\n      95K: 0.55\n      105K: 0.65\n      115K: 0.45\n      125K: 0.42\n      135K: 0.38\n      145K: 0.32\n      155K: 0.28\n      165K: 0.25\n      175K: 0.22\n      195K: 0.2\n      215K: 0.18\n    nve_max: 0.65\n    nve_max_step: 105K\n    civo_prevention: true\n    vs_s0_eval_peak: 460 vs 821 (56%)\n    vs_s0_performance_gap: significant — s1 recovers slower and lower\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档的核心假设：s1 NVE 保持健康 (< 1.5×) 但 eval peak 显著低于 s0 (< 500\n    vs 821)。\n\n    当前 85K 数据（eval 152, ve_ratio 0.40）显示 s1 的学习速度远慢于 s0\n\n    （s0 在 85K 已达 364, s1 仅 152）。这种差异来自 seed-dependent 的学习动力学：\n\n    σ=0.2 噪声对 s1 的特定初始化更具破坏性，降低了有效 conditioning precision\n\n    到 s1 的学习过程无法充分利用时间信息的程度。\n\n    NVE 保持 < 1.0× 因为噪声确实阻止了 co-adaptation——\n\n    但代价是 s1 的学习效率显著降低。\n\n    这证实了 median 假设：noise 防住了 CIVO 但未能维持 baseline-competitive performance——\n\n    最优 σ 不仅是 environment-specific 还可能是 seed/initialization-specific。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: TCN σ=0.2 Walker per-seed comparison\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_peak\n    - nve_max\n    - prevention\n    - baseline_%\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - 821\n      - 0.908\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 90%\n    - - s1 (projected)\n      - 460\n      - 0.65\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 50%\n    - - mean\n      - 641\n      - 0.78\n      - 2/2\n      - 70%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: TCN σ=0.2 s0 vs s1 eval trajectory — s0 reaches 821 but s1 only ~460'\n  - 'Fig: per-seed NVE overlay — both below 1.0× but s1 starts higher (more vulnerable)'\n  analysis: 'TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker 上 2/2 prevention（NVE < 1.5×），但性能 variance 大：\n\n    s0 达 90% baseline 而 s1 仅 ~50%。Per-seed eval peak 在 [460, 821] 范围内，\n\n    mean ~641（70% baseline）。这比 untreated 008d 好得多（82-268, 9-29%），\n\n    但不够 robust 来作为 universal recommendation。\n\n    论文应报告 per-seed variation 并讨论 initialization sensitivity。\n\n    '\n- name: TCN Cheetah s0 σ=0.5 (running — median prediction)\n  plan_id: 'registry: exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05'\n  description: 'TCN on Cheetah with σ=0.5. Current: 16K steps, eval 78.3.'\n  expected_results:\n    eval_trajectory_projected:\n      15K: 78\n      25K: 160\n      35K: 220\n      45K: 180\n      55K: 130\n      65K: 80\n      75K: 50\n      85K: 30\n      95K: 15\n      105K: 10\n    eval_peak: 220\n    eval_peak_step: 35K\n    nve_55K: 4.5\n    nve_65K: 8.2\n    nve_105K: 15.0\n    nve_max: 15.0\n    civo_prevention: false\n    vs_untreated_cheetah_010b:\n      010b_nve_peak: 70.6\n      tcn_nve_peak: 15.0\n      reduction_factor: 4.7× (but still >> 1.5×)\n      eval_peak_comparison: 220 vs 248 (similar)\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 CIVO severity 是 Walker 的 10-50×（NVE 8-108× vs 2-6×）。\n\n    σ=0.5 的噪声幅度约为 dt_emb std 的 0.5×——在 Walker 上这已经过量（σ=0.5 Walker NVE peak 4.0），\n\n    在 Cheetah 上仍然不足。Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 产生的 CIVO 力度\n\n    远超 σ=0.5 噪声的 damping capacity。\n\n    结果是 NVE 仍然攀升到 15×（虽然低于 untreated 的 70.6×，reduction ~4.7×），\n\n    但 15× 远超 1.5× threshold → CIVO 仍然发生。\n\n    这验证了 median 假设：σ=0.5 不足以覆盖 Cheetah 的 severity gap，\n\n    需要更大的 σ（可能 σ=2.0-5.0）但过大的 σ 会完全破坏有用信号。\n\n    这就是 \"narrow band\" problem——optimal σ 可能对 Cheetah 不存在。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: TCN Cheetah σ sensitivity prediction\n    columns:\n    - σ\n    - nve_max\n    - eval_peak\n    - prevention\n    rows:\n    - - 0.2 (actual)\n      - 1.9\n      - 300\n      - No (σ insufficient)\n    - - 0.5 (projected)\n      - 15.0\n      - 220\n      - No (still insufficient)\n    - - 1.0 (hypothetical)\n      - 6.0\n      - 100\n      - No (destroys signal)\n    - - 2.0 (hypothetical)\n      - 2.5\n      - 50\n      - No (all signal lost)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Cheetah TCN failure — NVE still explodes despite σ=0.5 noise'\n  - 'Fig: Cross-environment TCN comparison — Walker σ=0.2 succeeds vs Cheetah σ=0.5\n    fails'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah TCN 失败是 median 档的定义性结果。\n\n    Combined with Walker σ=0.2 success and σ=0.5 failure，结论是：\n\n    (1) Forward-pass noise 方向正确——TCN 确实 reduces CIVO severity (70.6→15×)\n\n    (2) 但 reduction 不足以跨 severity threshold\n\n    (3) Optimal σ 是 environment-specific 且可能不存在 universal value\n\n    论文 C8 claims 必须加 \"Walker Walk only\" scope 限定。\n\n    '\n- name: TCN Walker s0 σ=0.1 (running — median prediction)\n  plan_id: 'registry: exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01'\n  description: 'Lower noise test: σ=0.1 on Walker Walk. Currently early stage.'\n  expected_results:\n    eval_trajectory_projected:\n      25K: 200\n      35K: 280\n      45K: 350\n      55K: 300\n      65K: 250\n      75K: 200\n      85K: 280\n      95K: 320\n      105K: 380\n      115K: 450\n      135K: 500\n      155K: 530\n      175K: 580\n      195K: 560\n      215K: 550\n    eval_peak: 580\n    eval_peak_step: 175K\n    nve_max: 1.65\n    nve_max_step: 65K\n    nve_final: 0.25\n    civo_prevention: false\n    note: NVE briefly breaches 1.5× — σ=0.1 provides insufficient noise to prevent\n      transient CIVO\n  result_rationale: 'σ=0.1 噪声幅度仅为 dt_emb std 的 10%，不足以显著降低 conditioning precision。\n\n    RSSM 和 critic 仍然可以在噪声背景下提取足够精确的 dt 信号来建立 co-adaptation。\n\n    NVE 在 55-75K 区间可能短暂突破 1.5×（与 σ=0.2 的 0.908 peak 对比，\n\n    σ=0.1 的 damping capacity 约为 σ=0.2 的一半）。\n\n    但因为噪声不为零，CIVO 不会达到 untreated 的严重程度——\n\n    更像是 \"attenuated CIVO\" 而非 \"prevented CIVO\"。\n\n    最终可能 self-correct（类似 009b 的轨迹），eval 恢复到 ~550（60% baseline）。\n\n    σ=0.1 < σ=0.2 < σ=0.5 构成 dose-response：\n\n    太少 (0.1) → attenuated but not prevented；\n\n    适中 (0.2) → prevented in Walker；\n\n    太多 (0.5) → prevented but performance destroyed。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker TCN dose-response (σ sweep)\n    columns:\n    - σ\n    - nve_max\n    - eval_peak\n    - prevention\n    - performance\n    rows:\n    - - 0 (untreated 008d)\n      - '4.12'\n      - '167'\n      - 'No'\n      - 18%\n    - - 0.1 (projected)\n      - '1.65'\n      - '580'\n      - No (borderline)\n      - 63%\n    - - 0.2 (s0 actual)\n      - '0.908'\n      - '821'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 90%\n    - - 0.2 (s1 projected)\n      - '0.65'\n      - '460'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 50%\n    - - 0.5 (s0 actual)\n      - '4.0'\n      - '366'\n      - No (oscillatory)\n      - 40%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: σ dose-response curve — there is a narrow effective band around σ=0.2 for\n    Walker'\n  analysis: 'σ=0.1 的 borderline 结果进一步确认 optimal σ 的 narrow band 特性。\n\n    Walker 的 effective σ range 大约是 [0.15, 0.35]，\n\n    这个 band 的位置和宽度是 environment-specific 的。\n\n    论文 Section 6 应讨论这一 calibration challenge 并推荐 adaptive σ scheduling。\n\n    '\n- name: TCN PickCube s0 σ=0.2 (running — median prediction)\n  plan_id: 'registry: exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02'\n  description: TCN on PickCube (manipulation task). Tests cross-task-type generalization.\n  expected_results:\n    eval_peak: 35\n    eval_final: 22\n    nve_peak: 2.8\n    nve_final: 0.08\n    civo_prevention: false\n    pattern: transient CIVO → value collapse (similar to exp_019b)\n    note: PickCube dynamics fundamentally different from locomotion — σ=0.2 not calibrated\n      for this task\n  result_rationale: 'PickCube 是 manipulation task（抓取并放置），dynamics 与 locomotion 完全不同——\n\n    contact dynamics 是 discontinuous（抓住/未抓住），reward 是 sparse（成功/失败）。\n\n    σ=0.2 的校准基于 Walker 的 RSSM fidelity gap profile，对 PickCube 未必适用。\n\n    PickCube 的 baseline 性能本就较低 (~58-69 eval)，CIVO 表现为\n\n    transient overestimation → value collapse（与 exp_019b 相似）。\n\n    TCN 不太可能在 PickCube 上成功，因为：\n\n    (1) σ=0.2 未针对 manipulation task 校准\n\n    (2) PickCube 的 CIVO 模式是 transient → value collapse，而非 sustained amplification\n\n    (3) Sparse reward 环境中 noise 对 learning signal 的破坏更严重\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: PickCube TCN — similar trajectory to untreated exp_019b, TCN ineffective'\n  analysis: 'PickCube TCN 失败（如果确认）进一步支持 median 档的 \"no universal σ\" 结论。\n\n    但 PickCube 结果应作为 supplementary material 而非 main text，\n\n    因为 PickCube 的 CIVO 模式本就与 locomotion 不同（transient vs sustained）。\n\n    论文应 scope C8 claims 为 \"locomotion tasks with sustained CIVO pattern\"。'\n","numLines":1888,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1888}}}
